(4728681, 682895, 75532, '<td valign="top">it seems a bit out of focus almost but her smile makes up for it :)</td>', 'it seems a bit out of focus almost but her smile makes up for it :)', '2008-05-28 01:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728687, 682739, 93927, '<td valign="top">hmmm... I think I know you...<br/>If this isn''t who I think it is, I''m sorry for sounding horribly creepy.</td>', 'hmmm... I think I know you...If this isn''t who I think it is, I''m sorry for sounding horribly creepy.', '2008-05-28 01:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728692, 682014, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious and AWESOME! FABULOUS work with the colors and lighting especially using basic</td>', 'This is hilarious and AWESOME! FABULOUS work with the colors and lighting especially using basic', '2008-05-28 01:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728697, 682841, 45857, '<td valign="top">realy like the simplicity</td>', 'realy like the simplicity', '2008-05-28 01:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728702, 682573, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is incredibly unique and looks amazing in BW</td>', 'This is incredibly unique and looks amazing in BW', '2008-05-28 01:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728755, 682772, 27617, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of rule of thirds! However, as I am sure you know this could have been wonderful if it were in focus. Make sure you set your autofocus right on those pretty little eyes! if you are having trouble cause she is moving manual focus where she will end up and then take the shot when she gets there as she spins. This will be much more acurate then you camera desperately trying to keep up with you subject. I hope I helped!</td>', 'Good composition and use of rule of thirds! However, as I am sure you know this could have been wonderful if it were in focus. Make sure you set your autofocus right on those pretty little eyes! if you are having trouble cause she is moving manual focus where she will end up and then take the shot when she gets there as she spins. This will be much more acurate then you camera desperately trying to keep up with you subject. I hope I helped!', '2008-05-28 01:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728758, 681577, 93927, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but I''m sure you''ll be hung on the "DNMC" cross, lol.</td>', 'Nice picture, but I''m sure you''ll be hung on the "DNMC" cross, lol.', '2008-05-28 01:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728759, 682014, 93927, '<td valign="top">Love it. 10. The end.</td>', 'Love it. 10. The end.', '2008-05-28 01:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728779, 682292, 75386, '<td valign="top">10!<br/>Great shot, awesome work here<br/>Love the:<br/>1. expression and pose<br/>2. the framing<br/>3. the camera position<br/>4. the exposure settings</td>', '10!Great shot, awesome work hereLove the:1. expression and pose2. the framing3. the camera position4. the exposure settings', '2008-05-28 01:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728781, 682422, 27617, '<td valign="top">Ah the plague of basic editing and the inability to clone. I''m sure you noticed the red thing in the bottom left when you got home and couldn''t crop as it was to close to her face. However, I would have still cropped it really close and made it a tight headshot for this challenge just to remove that distraction. <br/>Overall though I really like the composition. I know you will probably get slammed for the dead space to the right but I do it all the time! Honestly I think it adds to a photo to see a little of the enviroment... it looks more movie-ish. Also the lighting its very soft (looks like a big window?) and complements her well. Good job!</td>', 'Ah the plague of basic editing and the inability to clone. I''m sure you noticed the red thing in the bottom left when you got home and couldn''t crop as it was to close to her face. However, I would have still cropped it really close and made it a tight headshot for this challenge just to remove that distraction. Overall though I really like the composition. I know you will probably get slammed for the dead space to the right but I do it all the time! Honestly I think it adds to a photo to see a little of the enviroment... it looks more movie-ish. Also the lighting its very soft (looks like a big window?) and complements her well. Good job!', '2008-05-28 01:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728784, 682889, 27617, '<td valign="top">hahahahahaha the expression is priceless! good shot!</td>', 'hahahahahaha the expression is priceless! good shot!', '2008-05-28 01:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728785, 682972, 14620, '<td valign="top">Oh My goodness!!  Look who''s growing up!! Beautiful, beautiful in sooo many ways.  So nice to see her cute face.</td>', 'Oh My goodness!!  Look who''s growing up!! Beautiful, beautiful in sooo many ways.  So nice to see her cute face.', '2008-05-28 01:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
