(4729638, 682579, 72929, '<td valign="top">Kill hannah? I don''t get it. Shes not looking at the camera either, seems disinterested.</td>', 'Kill hannah? I don''t get it. Shes not looking at the camera either, seems disinterested.', '2008-05-28 10:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729639, 681765, 72929, '<td valign="top">cute way to work a bug / macro in the challenge :)</td>', 'cute way to work a bug / macro in the challenge :)', '2008-05-28 10:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729642, 682009, 72929, '<td valign="top">like the hair blowing in the wind. not sure about the comp / crop.</td>', 'like the hair blowing in the wind. not sure about the comp / crop.', '2008-05-28 10:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729643, 682884, 72929, '<td valign="top">Indeed, classic pose. Would''ve like to have seen some additional fill for the shadows.</td>', 'Indeed, classic pose. Would''ve like to have seen some additional fill for the shadows.', '2008-05-28 10:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729655, 682145, 72929, '<td valign="top">If I tilt my head to look at the pic, that means the tilt wasn''t a good idea. I''m tilting my head... too much tilt! Plus the colors make her skin tones look cold / dead. Fix those two things, then her nice smile, the soft lighting and unobtrusive background would stand out as positives more.</td>', 'If I tilt my head to look at the pic, that means the tilt wasn''t a good idea. I''m tilting my head... too much tilt! Plus the colors make her skin tones look cold / dead. Fix those two things, then her nice smile, the soft lighting and unobtrusive background would stand out as positives more.', '2008-05-28 10:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729664, 682373, 72929, '<td valign="top">Pretty photo, but... her face is too dark, the fan commands way too much attention away from her face, the fan is in focus, not her face. There''s also mixed color lighting that doesn''t look intentional (blue on the left, red on the right)</td>', 'Pretty photo, but... her face is too dark, the fan commands way too much attention away from her face, the fan is in focus, not her face. There''s also mixed color lighting that doesn''t look intentional (blue on the left, red on the right)', '2008-05-28 10:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729670, 681964, 72929, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic lighting and good crop. Best I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Nice dramatic lighting and good crop. Best I''ve seen so far.', '2008-05-28 10:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729676, 681356, 72929, '<td valign="top">clever title. Looks a bit dark... the white dress should be white, not grey.</td>', 'clever title. Looks a bit dark... the white dress should be white, not grey.', '2008-05-28 10:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729684, 681169, 72929, '<td valign="top">Good comp and pose, but artificial lighting is obvious, detracts from natural scene :( Color balance looks a bit too green/ yellow on my monitor.</td>', 'Good comp and pose, but artificial lighting is obvious, detracts from natural scene :( Color balance looks a bit too green/ yellow on my monitor.', '2008-05-28 10:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729698, 682954, 72929, '<td valign="top">With a little more dramatic PP (deeper blacks, punchier colors) this would have stood out even more. Like the blue eyes + blue blanket, good color integration.</td>', 'With a little more dramatic PP (deeper blacks, punchier colors) this would have stood out even more. Like the blue eyes + blue blanket, good color integration.', '2008-05-28 10:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729700, 682274, 72929, '<td valign="top">All I see are armpits, sorry :(</td>', 'All I see are armpits, sorry :(', '2008-05-28 10:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
