(4729822, 682319, 72929, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose, makeup and composition. Dont like the overhead shadows so much, would''ve helped to have a reflector or more fill under her chin.</td>', 'Interesting pose, makeup and composition. Dont like the overhead shadows so much, would''ve helped to have a reflector or more fill under her chin.', '2008-05-28 10:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729849, 682969, 72929, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and BW conversion</td>', 'Nice lighting and BW conversion', '2008-05-28 10:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729855, 682687, 72929, '<td valign="top">the pose looks... out of place, doesn''t fit the title or location. Looks forced / fake :( Looks like you hit the shadow/higlight tool pretty hard too. Lighting is challenging at best in this scene.</td>', 'the pose looks... out of place, doesn''t fit the title or location. Looks forced / fake :( Looks like you hit the shadow/higlight tool pretty hard too. Lighting is challenging at best in this scene.', '2008-05-28 10:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729863, 682460, 72929, '<td valign="top">nice textures and use of contrast (texture of background and shawl vs smooth) to draw my eyes to her face. Lighten her face a bit and it would be perfect.</td>', 'nice textures and use of contrast (texture of background and shawl vs smooth) to draw my eyes to her face. Lighten her face a bit and it would be perfect.', '2008-05-28 10:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729867, 682563, 68546, '<td valign="top">This looks like a really nice portrait with way too much processing. The skin is a white/grey colour and looks like a mannequin due to heavy handed nise reduction. On a lighting front I would say it''s very nice soft light but could use a little light into the eyes which are very dark and don''t have enough of a catchlight in them. Lots of potential but a few things really detract from the shot IMO</td>', 'This looks like a really nice portrait with way too much processing. The skin is a white/grey colour and looks like a mannequin due to heavy handed nise reduction. On a lighting front I would say it''s very nice soft light but could use a little light into the eyes which are very dark and don''t have enough of a catchlight in them. Lots of potential but a few things really detract from the shot IMO', '2008-05-28 11:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729871, 681206, 72929, '<td valign="top">yikes, blown out face</td>', 'yikes, blown out face', '2008-05-28 11:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729873, 682139, 72929, '<td valign="top">flat lighting</td>', 'flat lighting', '2008-05-28 11:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
