(4729923, 682972, 36382, '<td valign="top">The light is lovely and soft.  I like the way her hair stands out from the dark background.  I wish you had included her legs.</td>', 'The light is lovely and soft.  I like the way her hair stands out from the dark background.  I wish you had included her legs.', '2008-05-28 11:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
