(4729974, 681508, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait but I''m not sure why you chose to present it at an angle.  To my eye, it doesn''t really add anything to your shot.</td>', 'This is a nice portrait but I''m not sure why you chose to present it at an angle.  To my eye, it doesn''t really add anything to your shot.', '2008-05-28 12:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
