(4729981, 681700, 58457, '<td valign="top">there is definitely a sense of humor in this photograph with those huge eyes and indifferent expression.</td>', 'there is definitely a sense of humor in this photograph with those huge eyes and indifferent expression.', '2008-05-28 12:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
