(4729984, 682935, 58457, '<td valign="top">nice environmental portrait.  To nitpick, if the shoulders could be toned down a bit as they and her right arm are a bit blown.  However, the face and background look great.</td>', 'nice environmental portrait.  To nitpick, if the shoulders could be toned down a bit as they and her right arm are a bit blown.  However, the face and background look great.', '2008-05-28 12:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4729987, 681170, 39679, '<td valign="top">This looks like you shot it with a tilt shift lens and I love the effect of a very shallow DOF.  It''s a good portrait in it''s own right but adding such a shallow DOF really brings an interesting dimension to your shot.  Well done.</td>', 'This looks like you shot it with a tilt shift lens and I love the effect of a very shallow DOF.  It''s a good portrait in it''s own right but adding such a shallow DOF really brings an interesting dimension to your shot.  Well done.', '2008-05-28 12:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
