(4729992, 682941, 58457, '<td valign="top">ha!  nobody ever said a human female!   cute pet portrait and stacks up technially against the stronger human portraits.  not sure how you''ll do on this one though...</td>', 'ha!  nobody ever said a human female!   cute pet portrait and stacks up technially against the stronger human portraits.  not sure how you''ll do on this one though...', '2008-05-28 12:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
