(4730036, 682587, 67258, '<td valign="top">You have articulated a sense of yearning, of wistfulness perhaps, well.  There is a hint of narrative, but also a degree of ambiguity which I like.  In terms of the technicals, I feel this could be stronger:  perhaps a little of the eye visible, and a slightly different arrangement of the hair (I find the peice behind her open mouth rather distracting).  The photo overall hasa rather flat feeling; whether greater sharpness or different lighting would help I am unsure.</td>', 'You have articulated a sense of yearning, of wistfulness perhaps, well.  There is a hint of narrative, but also a degree of ambiguity which I like.  In terms of the technicals, I feel this could be stronger:  perhaps a little of the eye visible, and a slightly different arrangement of the hair (I find the peice behind her open mouth rather distracting).  The photo overall hasa rather flat feeling; whether greater sharpness or different lighting would help I am unsure.', '2008-05-28 12:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730040, 681373, 72096, '<td valign="top">I disagree... a portrait is the facial image of a person... unless specifically referring to the likeness thereof. Nice picture of your bitch.  Maybe if they said the portrait of a bitch... or portrait of a house or a camera.</td>', 'I disagree... a portrait is the facial image of a person... unless specifically referring to the likeness thereof. Nice picture of your bitch.  Maybe if they said the portrait of a bitch... or portrait of a house or a camera.', '2008-05-28 12:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730041, 680748, 67258, '<td valign="top">An unusual and quite pleasing composition with pleasant soft lighting.  the image quality seems somewhat below par, and I wonder if this was taken either at a very high ISO or else a substantial crop from a much larger image.</td>', 'An unusual and quite pleasing composition with pleasant soft lighting.  the image quality seems somewhat below par, and I wonder if this was taken either at a very high ISO or else a substantial crop from a much larger image.', '2008-05-28 12:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730045, 682062, 67258, '<td valign="top">She looks like she has been hanging there for a while!  Not the most flattering position (unless she normally has that rather vivid colouration!) but one that may well be typical of the child!  I would like to have seen a much shallower depth of field thus allowing the grass in the background to blur more.</td>', 'She looks like she has been hanging there for a while!  Not the most flattering position (unless she normally has that rather vivid colouration!) but one that may well be typical of the child!  I would like to have seen a much shallower depth of field thus allowing the grass in the background to blur more.', '2008-05-28 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
