(4730417, 682340, 82503, '<td valign="top">Ok, ok, ok, I understand you all love your cats and dogs. They mean a lot to you and you like to take pictures of them. But please, don''t enter them in <i>every</i> challenge. There was even a dog in the bicycle challenge! &lt;\rant&gt;<br/> <br/>So: DNMC, this is clearly not what was meant.</td>', 'Ok, ok, ok, I understand you all love your cats and dogs. They mean a lot to you and you like to take pictures of them. But please, don''t enter them in every challenge. There was even a dog in the bicycle challenge! <\rant> So: DNMC, this is clearly not what was meant.', '2008-05-28 15:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
