(4730539, 682018, 82503, '<td valign="top">Not my kinda girl, but a beautiful shot! The lighting and the pose are great. This should do very well. 9.</td>', 'Not my kinda girl, but a beautiful shot! The lighting and the pose are great. This should do very well. 9.', '2008-05-28 15:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730556, 682286, 82503, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good lighting and composition, and a lovely model you have. I also like the dress (at least what we can see of it), but I guess that it will cost you a few points with the prude crowd. 9. (The only thing I don''t like about the image is that the glass of the reflection seems a bit dirty.)</td>', 'Nice idea, good lighting and composition, and a lovely model you have. I also like the dress (at least what we can see of it), but I guess that it will cost you a few points with the prude crowd. 9. (The only thing I don''t like about the image is that the glass of the reflection seems a bit dirty.)', '2008-05-28 15:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730557, 682009, 82503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture (and girl). One of the best non-studio shots in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful picture (and girl). One of the best non-studio shots in the challenge.', '2008-05-28 15:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
