(4731449, 682923, 82985, '<td valign="top">Ah!  Sandman''s Sister!  I like this, and she certainly captures that spirit very well, and is a lovely subject.  You nailed the exposure and focus on her, the sense of paleness is spot-on.  I presume the basic editing rules prevent it, but I would like to see the background much less bright--she should be the brightest element in the image, as she is truly luminous here.  I do like the slightly off center crop to this, but you might be able to crop in from each side some, and still retain that off-center dynamic.  8</td>', 'Ah!  Sandman''s Sister!  I like this, and she certainly captures that spirit very well, and is a lovely subject.  You nailed the exposure and focus on her, the sense of paleness is spot-on.  I presume the basic editing rules prevent it, but I would like to see the background much less bright--she should be the brightest element in the image, as she is truly luminous here.  I do like the slightly off center crop to this, but you might be able to crop in from each side some, and still retain that off-center dynamic.  8', '2008-05-28 23:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731450, 681814, 82985, '<td valign="top">lovely, luminous, well composed, would only burn down the lower right corner when the rules allow :-)  8</td>', 'lovely, luminous, well composed, would only burn down the lower right corner when the rules allow :-)  8', '2008-05-28 23:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
