(4731475, 682718, 90947, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop.  Lovely lady, what is her heritage?  Perhaps you could have moved Adelina a bit further to her right to minimize the bright spots that blew out in the fur.  All in all, very nice.</td>', 'Interesting crop.  Lovely lady, what is her heritage?  Perhaps you could have moved Adelina a bit further to her right to minimize the bright spots that blew out in the fur.  All in all, very nice.', '2008-05-28 23:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731477, 681999, 90947, '<td valign="top">She does have an interesting look in her eye.  Shot might make use of a little increase in contrast.  Great DOF control.</td>', 'She does have an interesting look in her eye.  Shot might make use of a little increase in contrast.  Great DOF control.', '2008-05-28 23:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731482, 682029, 90947, '<td valign="top">very curious expression.  I have a couple observations that only you can judge.  1.  Does the shot suffer from short focal length distortion?<br/>2.  I think the eyes are not quite in focus.<br/>You might have made us of a reflector to soften the shadow from her nose.<br/> <br/>Take what I say with a grain of salt.  You did a great job.</td>', 'very curious expression.  I have a couple observations that only you can judge.  1.  Does the shot suffer from short focal length distortion?2.  I think the eyes are not quite in focus.You might have made us of a reflector to soften the shadow from her nose. Take what I say with a grain of salt.  You did a great job.', '2008-05-28 23:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
