(4731493, 682433, 90947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful body and ready to go.  I think it might have been better without the picnic table (?) masking her right foot.</td>', 'Beautiful body and ready to go.  I think it might have been better without the picnic table (?) masking her right foot.', '2008-05-28 23:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
