(4731764, 682943, 90947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful young lady.  I like the several contrasts and comparisons.  Soft smooth warm skin, vs the hard cold rusty Iron of the engine.  The wear on the jeans compares to the wear of the engine.  The bright red of her blouse compared to the dull red/brown of the rust.  Does the model happen to be 36?  No, I didn''t thinks so.<br/> <br/>As the pretty model should be the main subject, I would have cropped it, or zoomed in, a bit to bring focus to her.  It could by my monitor, but I think she could use a little more light under the bill of her cap.  <br/> <br/>I really like this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful young lady.  I like the several contrasts and comparisons.  Soft smooth warm skin, vs the hard cold rusty Iron of the engine.  The wear on the jeans compares to the wear of the engine.  The bright red of her blouse compared to the dull red/brown of the rust.  Does the model happen to be 36?  No, I didn''t thinks so. As the pretty model should be the main subject, I would have cropped it, or zoomed in, a bit to bring focus to her.  It could by my monitor, but I think she could use a little more light under the bill of her cap.   I really like this shot.', '2008-05-29 01:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
