(4732011, 682422, 60195, '<td valign="top">Haha... Jenny?  Is that you?  Great title, and great image... nice touch with the DoF on the payphone.  Not sure how many people will get it though - too bad. <br/>Oh... and did I mention that your model is stunning?  :O)</td>', 'Haha... Jenny?  Is that you?  Great title, and great image... nice touch with the DoF on the payphone.  Not sure how many people will get it though - too bad. Oh... and did I mention that your model is stunning?  :O)', '2008-05-29 02:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732012, 681740, 53594, '<td valign="top">A good shot but I don''t think a silhouette can be considered a portrait by definition.</td>', 'A good shot but I don''t think a silhouette can be considered a portrait by definition.', '2008-05-29 02:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732014, 682976, 53594, '<td valign="top">Your never to old to swing.....A little fill-in light to the face and cropping out the swing post to the right may have improved the results.</td>', 'Your never to old to swing.....A little fill-in light to the face and cropping out the swing post to the right may have improved the results.', '2008-05-29 02:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732018, 682018, 53594, '<td valign="top">Although I have not finished viewing and voting, but this is the best picture I have seen so far in this challenge. Great focus, great colors, great composition and and a beautiful model. What else can a photographer ask for!!! A definite 10 in my book.</td>', 'Although I have not finished viewing and voting, but this is the best picture I have seen so far in this challenge. Great focus, great colors, great composition and and a beautiful model. What else can a photographer ask for!!! A definite 10 in my book.', '2008-05-29 02:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732020, 682014, 60195, '<td valign="top">Clear Blue in my book.  My only 10 in the challenge. nicely done!</td>', 'Clear Blue in my book.  My only 10 in the challenge. nicely done!', '2008-05-29 02:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732030, 682286, 60195, '<td valign="top">One of my top 3 in this challenge.  Great pose, love the reflection, and great natural lighting.  Well done.</td>', 'One of my top 3 in this challenge.  Great pose, love the reflection, and great natural lighting.  Well done.', '2008-05-29 02:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732037, 682053, 53594, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good placement of your subject to control the natural light. The background could have been slightly more blurred to emphasize your main subject.</td>', 'Very nice. Good placement of your subject to control the natural light. The background could have been slightly more blurred to emphasize your main subject.', '2008-05-29 02:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732039, 682724, 53594, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, good lighting and interesting expression on her face. Noise control could have been better and the object in the lower right hand corner is very distracting.</td>', 'Very nice portrait, good lighting and interesting expression on her face. Noise control could have been better and the object in the lower right hand corner is very distracting.', '2008-05-29 02:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
