(4733446, 682976, 90947, '<td valign="top">You''re never too old for swinging.  She is a lovely young lady and obviously has something on her mind.  I wonder what it is.  I like that you gave a lot of context for her although I think you might have narrowed the DOF a bit more.  I know how hard that is when one is shooting in a bright environment.  While the shadows are nice, I would have preferred her face to be a bit brighter; all the better to see the wonderful expression.</td>', 'You''re never too old for swinging.  She is a lovely young lady and obviously has something on her mind.  I wonder what it is.  I like that you gave a lot of context for her although I think you might have narrowed the DOF a bit more.  I know how hard that is when one is shooting in a bright environment.  While the shadows are nice, I would have preferred her face to be a bit brighter; all the better to see the wonderful expression.', '2008-05-29 20:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733455, 682923, 90947, '<td valign="top">Interesting title for someone so obviously filled with spirit; a very pretty model.  Great DOF control.  My only comment is that you blew out her shoulder.  This might have made good use of a portrait crop instead of the landscape view.</td>', 'Interesting title for someone so obviously filled with spirit; a very pretty model.  Great DOF control.  My only comment is that you blew out her shoulder.  This might have made good use of a portrait crop instead of the landscape view.', '2008-05-29 20:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
