(4733594, 682796, 53594, '<td valign="top">Interesting body painting. Is that New York City? If it is, the old adage "Only in New York" still applies. Only thing though, I would have cropped out the shadow on bottom left of the photo.</td>', 'Interesting body painting. Is that New York City? If it is, the old adage "Only in New York" still applies. Only thing though, I would have cropped out the shadow on bottom left of the photo.', '2008-05-29 22:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733596, 682614, 53594, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture....nice smile on your model....good lighting....but too much white background. Good job!!!</td>', 'Pretty picture....nice smile on your model....good lighting....but too much white background. Good job!!!', '2008-05-29 22:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733597, 682923, 7810, '<td valign="top">I like this shot ... great imagery.<br/> <br/>I like your model''s expression ... kind of adds tension to the shot</td>', 'I like this shot ... great imagery. I like your model''s expression ... kind of adds tension to the shot', '2008-05-29 22:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733603, 681700, 62578, '<td valign="top">oh. my. gosh. how sweet is she!!!  I love her little head! lol</td>', 'oh. my. gosh. how sweet is she!!!  I love her little head! lol', '2008-05-29 22:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733644, 682502, 90947, '<td valign="top">Nice location.  I have been to Madison County and visited the bridges.  It is a great idea.  I like the pose, but the shadow hides the model''s face.  You might have been able to use a reflector or some fill flash to light her face.  I have a real nitpick... the leaves in the background look over sharpened.  In fact, with the multiple pass image loading made the bright spots very evident, but that wouldn''t be the case with a print.</td>', 'Nice location.  I have been to Madison County and visited the bridges.  It is a great idea.  I like the pose, but the shadow hides the model''s face.  You might have been able to use a reflector or some fill flash to light her face.  I have a real nitpick... the leaves in the background look over sharpened.  In fact, with the multiple pass image loading made the bright spots very evident, but that wouldn''t be the case with a print.', '2008-05-29 22:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733648, 682062, 90947, '<td valign="top">Love the idea.  Very cute young lady.</td>', 'Love the idea.  Very cute young lady.', '2008-05-29 22:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733653, 682853, 90947, '<td valign="top">This is a very nicely framed shot with the slope of the arm mimicking the slope of the tree branch.  I don''t know what you would do about them, but the reflections of the leaves are very bright and the large bright spot directly above the model''s head is distracting.</td>', 'This is a very nicely framed shot with the slope of the arm mimicking the slope of the tree branch.  I don''t know what you would do about them, but the reflections of the leaves are very bright and the large bright spot directly above the model''s head is distracting.', '2008-05-29 22:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733657, 681166, 90947, '<td valign="top">I love the expression of wonder on your girl''s face and in her gate.  Beautiful picture of a beautiful young lady.</td>', 'I love the expression of wonder on your girl''s face and in her gate.  Beautiful picture of a beautiful young lady.', '2008-05-29 22:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733661, 682292, 90947, '<td valign="top">The softness of this shot, both in the execution and what I believe to be the skin quality make it very special.  I think you might consider removing whatever the white is that cuts diagonally across the image.  I think it hardens the shape of the nose and lips which is inconsistent with the rest of the image.  I love the focal point on the eyelashes.</td>', 'The softness of this shot, both in the execution and what I believe to be the skin quality make it very special.  I think you might consider removing whatever the white is that cuts diagonally across the image.  I think it hardens the shape of the nose and lips which is inconsistent with the rest of the image.  I love the focal point on the eyelashes.', '2008-05-29 22:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733670, 681740, 90947, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette of a powerful woman.  It makes me think "Helen Reddy".  Love the sky and clouds.  However, I am not sure I would call it a portrait.  Stunning photo.</td>', 'Nice silhouette of a powerful woman.  It makes me think "Helen Reddy".  Love the sky and clouds.  However, I am not sure I would call it a portrait.  Stunning photo.', '2008-05-29 22:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733674, 681206, 90947, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  Is this sort of an anti smoking image?  I do like the minimalism of the model''s face.  I am curious about what caused the peculiar nature of the shadow on the models forehead and cheek.  <br/> <br/>Very nice.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  Is this sort of an anti smoking image?  I do like the minimalism of the model''s face.  I am curious about what caused the peculiar nature of the shadow on the models forehead and cheek.   Very nice.', '2008-05-29 22:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733685, 680714, 90947, '<td valign="top">Good balance for the shot, with the tree counterbalancing the lady.  I wish the clouds in the sky weren''t blown out.  <br/> <br/>I would like to see her face and get a feel for why she finds herself in this spot.  I wonder what she accomplishing by opening her skirt.  I think it is very good that a photo can elicit such questions.  I wish the photo would help me find the answers.</td>', 'Good balance for the shot, with the tree counterbalancing the lady.  I wish the clouds in the sky weren''t blown out.   I would like to see her face and get a feel for why she finds herself in this spot.  I wonder what she accomplishing by opening her skirt.  I think it is very good that a photo can elicit such questions.  I wish the photo would help me find the answers.', '2008-05-29 23:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733687, 682586, 90947, '<td valign="top">Perfect, just perfect.</td>', 'Perfect, just perfect.', '2008-05-29 23:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733692, 681080, 53594, '<td valign="top">Very good attempt. As is often the case with single source directional lighting, harsh shadows are produced. Forgive me for being fussy but that single hair across her cheek......it irks me......Overall A Good Job.</td>', 'Very good attempt. As is often the case with single source directional lighting, harsh shadows are produced. Forgive me for being fussy but that single hair across her cheek......it irks me......Overall A Good Job.', '2008-05-29 23:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733695, 681818, 90947, '<td valign="top">I love window light.  Some day I am going to have to learn how to do it.  You have used window light to perfection.  Lovely young lady.  I like your shot very much.</td>', 'I love window light.  Some day I am going to have to learn how to do it.  You have used window light to perfection.  Lovely young lady.  I like your shot very much.', '2008-05-29 23:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733696, 681874, 53594, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture. May have been improved if you had cropped out some of the background on the left and right. Good job.</td>', 'Very pretty picture. May have been improved if you had cropped out some of the background on the left and right. Good job.', '2008-05-29 23:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733697, 682927, 90947, '<td valign="top">The slight blue color cast that I see seems to add to the pout.  Nice soft light and sharp focus on the eyes.  Very nice.</td>', 'The slight blue color cast that I see seems to add to the pout.  Nice soft light and sharp focus on the eyes.  Very nice.', '2008-05-29 23:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733699, 681344, 90947, '<td valign="top">The high contrast of the black and white sure makes this shot.  Great texture on the hat... perfect exposure.</td>', 'The high contrast of the black and white sure makes this shot.  Great texture on the hat... perfect exposure.', '2008-05-29 23:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733703, 682351, 53594, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. Nice, happy expression on her face. Nice composition...love the reflection....Very good job.</td>', 'I like this photo. Nice, happy expression on her face. Nice composition...love the reflection....Very good job.', '2008-05-29 23:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
