(4733713, 681551, 90947, '<td valign="top">I like maternity shots.  This is a nice silhouette.  Just a nit, the defocus of the background softens the model''s face''s outline.</td>', 'I like maternity shots.  This is a nice silhouette.  Just a nit, the defocus of the background softens the model''s face''s outline.', '2008-05-29 23:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
