(4733750, 682944, 53594, '<td valign="top">This a very good picture. Great smile on your model. Good lighting and color rendition. Good Job.</td>', 'This a very good picture. Great smile on your model. Good lighting and color rendition. Good Job.', '2008-05-29 23:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733754, 682217, 90947, '<td valign="top">I expect it is just me, but the eyebrow stud pulls my attention from the rest of the image.  Apart from that, I like the mix of soft tones throughout.  It almost looks like a infrared image.  Great focus, crisp lines.</td>', 'I expect it is just me, but the eyebrow stud pulls my attention from the rest of the image.  Apart from that, I like the mix of soft tones throughout.  It almost looks like a infrared image.  Great focus, crisp lines.', '2008-05-29 23:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733759, 682422, 90947, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot of a beautiful young lady.  Great window light.  I would think about cropping it to a vertical show to loose the telephone.  It is almost the first thing I noticed when looking at the image.  Apart from that, it is superb.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot of a beautiful young lady.  Great window light.  I would think about cropping it to a vertical show to loose the telephone.  It is almost the first thing I noticed when looking at the image.  Apart from that, it is superb.', '2008-05-29 23:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733766, 681169, 90947, '<td valign="top">Is that an order?  Enjoying the Lake.  <br/> <br/>Great framing and DOF.  I would never have thought of it prior to taking the shot, but with the benefit of seeing this shot, I would have chosen tan or green slacks and shoes.  Love lady in a beautiful location.</td>', 'Is that an order?  Enjoying the Lake.   Great framing and DOF.  I would never have thought of it prior to taking the shot, but with the benefit of seeing this shot, I would have chosen tan or green slacks and shoes.  Love lady in a beautiful location.', '2008-05-29 23:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733769, 682573, 38032, '<td valign="top">darn close to perfect.  I''d like to see just a small bit more above the glasses. 8</td>', 'darn close to perfect.  I''d like to see just a small bit more above the glasses. 8', '2008-05-29 23:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733772, 682948, 38032, '<td valign="top">Definitely a wow for me. A battle of classic and modern -color and not ... beauty and darkness - <br/>Minor quibbles: Something compositionally off just a smidge possibly in rotation - I can''t put my brain on it ... Also the pose seems a tad forced and the legs sort of cannot be found ... but overall very striking and engaging. 8, eight!</td>', 'Definitely a wow for me. A battle of classic and modern -color and not ... beauty and darkness - Minor quibbles: Something compositionally off just a smidge possibly in rotation - I can''t put my brain on it ... Also the pose seems a tad forced and the legs sort of cannot be found ... but overall very striking and engaging. 8, eight!', '2008-05-29 23:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733776, 682152, 90947, '<td valign="top">Hum, what is she looking at over her coffee cup.  This picture poses, at least for me, an interesting question.  Very nicely lit and posed.</td>', 'Hum, what is she looking at over her coffee cup.  This picture poses, at least for me, an interesting question.  Very nicely lit and posed.', '2008-05-29 23:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
