(4734829, 682422, 14867, '<td valign="top">Mmmh...the background is finally more distracting than adding a (not needed) story here.<br/>The portrait itself is good - but the orange thing in lower left corner.</td>', 'Mmmh...the background is finally more distracting than adding a (not needed) story here.The portrait itself is good - but the orange thing in lower left corner.', '2008-05-30 16:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734830, 682884, 14867, '<td valign="top">Harsh light, too much contrast IMO</td>', 'Harsh light, too much contrast IMO', '2008-05-30 16:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734834, 681969, 14867, '<td valign="top">The play with the shadows is surely creative and original. Sometimes beautiful (her forehead, under her eye) but unfortunately sometimes less (her nose...)</td>', 'The play with the shadows is surely creative and original. Sometimes beautiful (her forehead, under her eye) but unfortunately sometimes less (her nose...)', '2008-05-30 16:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735004, 682385, 23921, '<td valign="top">Lovely expression.</td>', 'Lovely expression.', '2008-05-30 18:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735165, 682886, 90947, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful baby beautifully lit.  I like the slight reflections on the table.  Rose is going to "love" this picture in about 12 or 13 years.</td>', 'What a beautiful baby beautifully lit.  I like the slight reflections on the table.  Rose is going to "love" this picture in about 12 or 13 years.', '2008-05-30 21:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735168, 682009, 90947, '<td valign="top">I really like the near (complete?) sepia tone.  I also like that her blowing hair is mimicked by the blowing grasses.  Very nice.</td>', 'I really like the near (complete?) sepia tone.  I also like that her blowing hair is mimicked by the blowing grasses.  Very nice.', '2008-05-30 21:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735169, 682408, 90947, '<td valign="top">Nice pose that shows some serious thinking going on behind those beautiful blue eyes. I am guessing she is thinking she is about done with the modeling business.  I like the non-discript background, but I think it could have been a little more out of focus.  Very nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice pose that shows some serious thinking going on behind those beautiful blue eyes. I am guessing she is thinking she is about done with the modeling business.  I like the non-discript background, but I think it could have been a little more out of focus.  Very nice lighting.', '2008-05-30 21:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735173, 682218, 89669, '<td valign="top">excellent photo. She has such a beautiful complexion. Well done</td>', 'excellent photo. She has such a beautiful complexion. Well done', '2008-05-30 21:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735174, 682935, 90947, '<td valign="top">This is an unusual pose, but I really like it because is lets us see into the gardener''s avocation.  Nicely framed.  I could have used a little shallower DOF.  Resting her chin on the spade is great!</td>', 'This is an unusual pose, but I really like it because is lets us see into the gardener''s avocation.  Nicely framed.  I could have used a little shallower DOF.  Resting her chin on the spade is great!', '2008-05-30 21:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735175, 682152, 89669, '<td valign="top">lacks overall interest.</td>', 'lacks overall interest.', '2008-05-30 21:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735176, 682899, 89669, '<td valign="top">It''s tough watching them grow up. My daughter is the same age. I am having a tough time as a father. Great photo! One for you to always remember.</td>', 'It''s tough watching them grow up. My daughter is the same age. I am having a tough time as a father. Great photo! One for you to always remember.', '2008-05-30 21:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735178, 682391, 89669, '<td valign="top">a little to dark in the upper right and lacks sharpness around the mouth. she does have a beautiful smile though.</td>', 'a little to dark in the upper right and lacks sharpness around the mouth. she does have a beautiful smile though.', '2008-05-30 21:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735180, 681344, 89669, '<td valign="top">a little to much contrast for me. the face is a little to hot.</td>', 'a little to much contrast for me. the face is a little to hot.', '2008-05-30 21:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735181, 682519, 89669, '<td valign="top">very soft. very beautiful. very well done.</td>', 'very soft. very beautiful. very well done.', '2008-05-30 21:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735186, 682400, 90947, '<td valign="top">So, where is the first half.  Sorry, for the little joke.  <br/> <br/>I like the the razor sharp eye with the very washed out skin.  I am not sure if it is really in photo or just in my monitor, but I see rather abrupt changes from essentially white to soft gray around the eye.</td>', 'So, where is the first half.  Sorry, for the little joke.   I like the the razor sharp eye with the very washed out skin.  I am not sure if it is really in photo or just in my monitor, but I see rather abrupt changes from essentially white to soft gray around the eye.', '2008-05-30 21:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735196, 681578, 90947, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful face, rich in the lines of experience.</td>', 'What a wonderful face, rich in the lines of experience.', '2008-05-30 21:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735198, 682718, 90414, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a snapshot than a planned portrait. You could have used that natural light on half of the face to get a similar half-frame look.</td>', 'Looks more like a snapshot than a planned portrait. You could have used that natural light on half of the face to get a similar half-frame look.', '2008-05-30 21:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735204, 682733, 90414, '<td valign="top">I like the shadowed areas below the cheeks. Nice portrait.</td>', 'I like the shadowed areas below the cheeks. Nice portrait.', '2008-05-30 21:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735206, 681964, 90414, '<td valign="top">Very mysterious and moody photo... Do I see 2 catchlights in her eyes?</td>', 'Very mysterious and moody photo... Do I see 2 catchlights in her eyes?', '2008-05-30 21:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735207, 682879, 90947, '<td valign="top">Very nice blending of the main lighting and the candles.  This is the first shot I have seen in this challenge in which I feel the face hardware adds to the shot.  I think I might have tried to remove the spot on the wall prior to the shot, or crop it out afterward.</td>', 'Very nice blending of the main lighting and the candles.  This is the first shot I have seen in this challenge in which I feel the face hardware adds to the shot.  I think I might have tried to remove the spot on the wall prior to the shot, or crop it out afterward.', '2008-05-30 21:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735208, 682421, 90947, '<td valign="top">I like the way the scarf and hood frame her face.  The lighting is great, bringing out the character in her face.</td>', 'I like the way the scarf and hood frame her face.  The lighting is great, bringing out the character in her face.', '2008-05-30 21:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735210, 681072, 90414, '<td valign="top">You captured those eyes beautifully!</td>', 'You captured those eyes beautifully!', '2008-05-30 22:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735211, 682889, 90947, '<td valign="top">Very cute young lady.  I am not sure the expression is an "I didn''t do it", but it is very interesting regardless of what one understands from the expression.  I hope someone kissed the little girls thumb before applying the bandage.</td>', 'Very cute young lady.  I am not sure the expression is an "I didn''t do it", but it is very interesting regardless of what one understands from the expression.  I hope someone kissed the little girls thumb before applying the bandage.', '2008-05-30 22:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735223, 682233, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting</td>', 'Beautiful lighting', '2008-05-30 22:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735226, 682765, 90947, '<td valign="top">Get enough ground... Coffee gone berserk.  I think this is a wonderful shot in that it has such a beautiful model placed into a messy state.  Great focus on the eyes.  I wonder... what is she looking at and wondering about.</td>', 'Get enough ground... Coffee gone berserk.  I think this is a wonderful shot in that it has such a beautiful model placed into a messy state.  Great focus on the eyes.  I wonder... what is she looking at and wondering about.', '2008-05-30 22:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735229, 682520, 90947, '<td valign="top">First portrait? Wonderful lighting and cropping.</td>', 'First portrait? Wonderful lighting and cropping.', '2008-05-30 22:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735231, 682009, 90414, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, very good shot, but her right hand is a bit washed out.</td>', 'Nice DOF, very good shot, but her right hand is a bit washed out.', '2008-05-30 22:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735233, 682972, 90947, '<td valign="top">Cute shot of a sunburned girl in lush grass.  While I would probably not thought of it at the time, I think the single blade of grass extending well above her waist is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Cute shot of a sunburned girl in lush grass.  While I would probably not thought of it at the time, I think the single blade of grass extending well above her waist is a bit distracting.', '2008-05-30 22:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735234, 682703, 90947, '<td valign="top">Lovely lady in a beautiful wedding dress.  I like the interlaced fingers.  Beautiful lighting.  Hard to go wrong with a lady this pretty.</td>', 'Lovely lady in a beautiful wedding dress.  I like the interlaced fingers.  Beautiful lighting.  Hard to go wrong with a lady this pretty.', '2008-05-30 22:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735235, 682537, 90947, '<td valign="top">Very nice pose and flowers for props.  I would like to see her face a little brighter, perhaps a reflector to keep the natural light look.</td>', 'Very nice pose and flowers for props.  I would like to see her face a little brighter, perhaps a reflector to keep the natural light look.', '2008-05-30 22:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735240, 682000, 90947, '<td valign="top">I like the sharp focus on her skin.  Beautiful skin tone.  I can only assume it is accurately rendered.  Beautiful.</td>', 'I like the sharp focus on her skin.  Beautiful skin tone.  I can only assume it is accurately rendered.  Beautiful.', '2008-05-30 22:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735244, 682286, 90414, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot - nicely planned and executed.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot - nicely planned and executed.', '2008-05-30 22:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735246, 682614, 90947, '<td valign="top">Great shot with the white background.  I have the feeling this shot could be suffering from over sharpening as demonstrated around her arm in front of the black blouse and the junction between her blouse and neckline.  <br/> <br/>In any event, this is a very nice portrait.</td>', 'Great shot with the white background.  I have the feeling this shot could be suffering from over sharpening as demonstrated around her arm in front of the black blouse and the junction between her blouse and neckline.   In any event, this is a very nice portrait.', '2008-05-30 22:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735249, 681048, 90947, '<td valign="top">Is this a portrait of a lady or a female dog?  They are both nice, but there are two.  I think there is a bit too much background.  I keep wanting to look up to see what is up there.</td>', 'Is this a portrait of a lady or a female dog?  They are both nice, but there are two.  I think there is a bit too much background.  I keep wanting to look up to see what is up there.', '2008-05-30 22:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735251, 682971, 90947, '<td valign="top">Very nice skin tone contrasting with the red of the lips.  Nice choice.</td>', 'Very nice skin tone contrasting with the red of the lips.  Nice choice.', '2008-05-30 22:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735253, 680956, 90947, '<td valign="top">Very nice image of life.  I am not sure they eyes are in sharp focus, but otherwise very nice.</td>', 'Very nice image of life.  I am not sure they eyes are in sharp focus, but otherwise very nice.', '2008-05-30 22:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735255, 681373, 90947, '<td valign="top">You are 100% percent.  Female is not limited to humans.  I think this she must be a very good friend.  I think I would have gone for a little longer focal length lens for a more natural look.</td>', 'You are 100% percent.  Female is not limited to humans.  I think this she must be a very good friend.  I think I would have gone for a little longer focal length lens for a more natural look.', '2008-05-30 22:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735257, 682000, 90414, '<td valign="top">Looks a little over-sharpened to me.</td>', 'Looks a little over-sharpened to me.', '2008-05-30 22:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735258, 681700, 90947, '<td valign="top">"Hey... what''s going on back here?"  Oh, how much they they learn by looking at their world.  This shot shows that.</td>', '"Hey... what''s going on back here?"  Oh, how much they they learn by looking at their world.  This shot shows that.', '2008-05-30 22:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735263, 682522, 90947, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful face.  Wonderful color in her jacket.  DOF is wonderful.  Her face might have lit a little brighter, but the lighting you have surly brings out the character etched by life.</td>', 'What a wonderful face.  Wonderful color in her jacket.  DOF is wonderful.  Her face might have lit a little brighter, but the lighting you have surly brings out the character etched by life.', '2008-05-30 22:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735265, 682119, 90947, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  I especially like the top lighting of her hair.  There is a lot of black background.  I might toy with a crop to a portrait format in lieu of the landscape used here.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  I especially like the top lighting of her hair.  There is a lot of black background.  I might toy with a crop to a portrait format in lieu of the landscape used here.', '2008-05-30 22:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735271, 682319, 90414, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a moody shot, nice depth... reminds me of a Tomb Raider type of pic.</td>', 'Wow, what a moody shot, nice depth... reminds me of a Tomb Raider type of pic.', '2008-05-30 22:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735272, 682319, 60581, '<td valign="top">nice light and shadow! very sharp and detailed!</td>', 'nice light and shadow! very sharp and detailed!', '2008-05-30 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735273, 682448, 90414, '<td valign="top">Great contrast with fine detail.</td>', 'Great contrast with fine detail.', '2008-05-30 22:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
