(4735287, 682460, 90947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lady.  I like the scarf surrounding her face.  The scarf wants to blend into background which I found curious; not really distracting, but a curiosity.  Samandiriel''s face is very nicely lit showing some considerable personality.  Very lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful lady.  I like the scarf surrounding her face.  The scarf wants to blend into background which I found curious; not really distracting, but a curiosity.  Samandiriel''s face is very nicely lit showing some considerable personality.  Very lovely.', '2008-05-30 22:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735288, 682772, 33672, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a bit soft. Nice candid though.</td>', 'Focus seems a bit soft. Nice candid though.', '2008-05-30 22:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735290, 682647, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Candid.</td>', 'Beautiful Candid.', '2008-05-30 22:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735292, 681087, 90947, '<td valign="top">I think I might have explored using the model''s finger in lieu of the tuft of hair which she appears to be blowing.  Great low key.  Very nice.</td>', 'I think I might have explored using the model''s finger in lieu of the tuft of hair which she appears to be blowing.  Great low key.  Very nice.', '2008-05-30 22:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735296, 682796, 33672, '<td valign="top">Street photography at its best. Great POV.</td>', 'Street photography at its best. Great POV.', '2008-05-30 22:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735297, 681969, 90414, '<td valign="top">The DOF and contrast in lighting really draws me into this photo. Excellent.</td>', 'The DOF and contrast in lighting really draws me into this photo. Excellent.', '2008-05-30 22:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735299, 682220, 90414, '<td valign="top">A little noisy, but cute shot.</td>', 'A little noisy, but cute shot.', '2008-05-30 22:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735300, 682522, 90414, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh and lighting.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh and lighting.', '2008-05-30 22:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735301, 680714, 33672, '<td valign="top">A little more contrast would help isolate the subject better.</td>', 'A little more contrast would help isolate the subject better.', '2008-05-30 22:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735302, 682653, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice full frame shot. Focus is a little soft though.</td>', 'Nice full frame shot. Focus is a little soft though.', '2008-05-30 22:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735303, 681304, 90947, '<td valign="top">Very interesting viewpoint and curious situation.  I guess "Captured" captures it.  It makes me want to know how she found herself in such a situation.  I think that is what a photo should do.</td>', 'Very interesting viewpoint and curious situation.  I guess "Captured" captures it.  It makes me want to know how she found herself in such a situation.  I think that is what a photo should do.', '2008-05-30 22:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735305, 682119, 33672, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting and composition.</td>', 'Perfect lighting and composition.', '2008-05-30 22:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735307, 682746, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp that creates great negative space.</td>', 'Nice comp that creates great negative space.', '2008-05-30 22:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735308, 682687, 90414, '<td valign="top">Great detail in her hair and legs, but at the expense of the blown out wall behind her.</td>', 'Great detail in her hair and legs, but at the expense of the blown out wall behind her.', '2008-05-30 22:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735310, 682448, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and high contrast.</td>', 'I like the tones and high contrast.', '2008-05-30 22:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735312, 682926, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp, great background.</td>', 'Nice comp, great background.', '2008-05-30 22:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735315, 682947, 90947, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot beautifully lit.  There is one single hair extending under her left eye that you might want to clone out after this competition.</td>', 'beautiful shot beautifully lit.  There is one single hair extending under her left eye that you might want to clone out after this competition.', '2008-05-30 22:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735316, 682745, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great title and negative space. Fits perfectly together.</td>', 'Great title and negative space. Fits perfectly together.', '2008-05-30 22:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735318, 682051, 90947, '<td valign="top">40 something is a great time... I can remember it, almost.  Great expression by one who appears to be successful and self confident.  Wonder DOF control and nice close cropping.</td>', '40 something is a great time... I can remember it, almost.  Great expression by one who appears to be successful and self confident.  Wonder DOF control and nice close cropping.', '2008-05-30 22:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735319, 681392, 90947, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  The young lady is lovely, with a confident relaxed smile.  I think your choice of framing is wonderful; leaving in the knee poking through the jeans adds to her charm.</td>', 'I like this shot.  The young lady is lovely, with a confident relaxed smile.  I think your choice of framing is wonderful; leaving in the knee poking through the jeans adds to her charm.', '2008-05-30 22:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735323, 682223, 90947, '<td valign="top">Very nice sepia tone.  Well lit and posed.</td>', 'Very nice sepia tone.  Well lit and posed.', '2008-05-30 23:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735328, 681072, 90947, '<td valign="top">what an interesting expression.  I love the lighting and the catch light.  I admitted to one other challenge entrant that I really need to learn to use window light.</td>', 'what an interesting expression.  I love the lighting and the catch light.  I admitted to one other challenge entrant that I really need to learn to use window light.', '2008-05-30 23:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735332, 682012, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic lighting. I wish the eye were a bit sharper</td>', 'I like the dramatic lighting. I wish the eye were a bit sharper', '2008-05-30 23:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735335, 681049, 90947, '<td valign="top">I like the glance over the shoulder.  I might explore a portrait crop removing much of the tree branch.  I am a bit confused by the apparent noise in the models skin... actually everywhere.</td>', 'I like the glance over the shoulder.  I might explore a portrait crop removing much of the tree branch.  I am a bit confused by the apparent noise in the models skin... actually everywhere.', '2008-05-30 23:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735337, 681979, 90947, '<td valign="top">Seminal cyborg... Interesting concept and execution.</td>', 'Seminal cyborg... Interesting concept and execution.', '2008-05-30 23:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735338, 681229, 88204, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic! The angle adds to the intrigue. I can''t decide if the contrast is too much. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very dramatic! The angle adds to the intrigue. I can''t decide if the contrast is too much. Very nice shot.', '2008-05-30 23:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735339, 682448, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, pose and composition.</td>', 'Great lighting, pose and composition.', '2008-05-30 23:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735341, 681373, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like the shot. Not crazy about the title.</td>', 'I like the shot. Not crazy about the title.', '2008-05-30 23:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735342, 682973, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, even in rather challenging harsh sunlight. Beautiful sharpness, warm color and expression.</td>', 'Nicely done, even in rather challenging harsh sunlight. Beautiful sharpness, warm color and expression.', '2008-05-30 23:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735344, 682422, 88204, '<td valign="top">Love the title! Well done!</td>', 'Love the title! Well done!', '2008-05-30 23:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
