(4735351, 681508, 90947, '<td valign="top">Great pose and the ukulele is a great prop.  I like the light tone, but I find it a little harsh.  Very nice.</td>', 'Great pose and the ukulele is a great prop.  I like the light tone, but I find it a little harsh.  Very nice.', '2008-05-30 23:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
