(4735496, 682708, 90947, '<td valign="top">I really like the very bright red contrasting the very gray background.  I think her face could be a brighter.  Perhaps a reflection would have both brightened her face and softened the shadow on her left cheek.</td>', 'I really like the very bright red contrasting the very gray background.  I think her face could be a brighter.  Perhaps a reflection would have both brightened her face and softened the shadow on her left cheek.', '2008-05-31 00:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
