(4735539, 682932, 94153, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture.</td>', 'Really nice picture.', '2008-05-31 00:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735554, 682218, 90947, '<td valign="top">I think I have seen 50 images of this model... self portrait?  This has a couple of characteristics that I would like to explore sometime.  First, is the tone and flat lighting.  In particular, I don''t know how your kept your lips so "colorless".  The second is what appears to be short lens distortion.  Did this contribute to the large eyes, or do you just have that large and beautiful.  Nice crisp focus on the eyes.</td>', 'I think I have seen 50 images of this model... self portrait?  This has a couple of characteristics that I would like to explore sometime.  First, is the tone and flat lighting.  In particular, I don''t know how your kept your lips so "colorless".  The second is what appears to be short lens distortion.  Did this contribute to the large eyes, or do you just have that large and beautiful.  Nice crisp focus on the eyes.', '2008-05-31 00:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735563, 682948, 90947, '<td valign="top">I am perplexed about this.  Is supposed to be a photo of desperation; from the title, I expect it is.  It is a shame... lovely lady so close to the real and metaphorical edge.  Very powerful shot.</td>', 'I am perplexed about this.  Is supposed to be a photo of desperation; from the title, I expect it is.  It is a shame... lovely lady so close to the real and metaphorical edge.  Very powerful shot.', '2008-05-31 00:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735574, 682616, 90947, '<td valign="top">How ya do''n.  Interesting pose and expression.  I think the B&amp;W works well.  I would liked to have the background less focused.  Nice flat light.</td>', 'How ya do''n.  Interesting pose and expression.  I think the B&W works well.  I would liked to have the background less focused.  Nice flat light.', '2008-05-31 01:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
