(4735832, 682687, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the tension created by her position in relation to the wall. The leading line of the shadow takes you almost to her face. The colors work well as a pseudo monochrome. Great shot</td>', 'I like the tension created by her position in relation to the wall. The leading line of the shadow takes you almost to her face. The colors work well as a pseudo monochrome. Great shot', '2008-05-31 05:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
