(4735848, 682385, 12611, '<td valign="top">I came back to this one to say its in my top 3- Its a bit sharpened but somehow it works with the black and whitish color scheme- great pose and send up to those world war two postcards which empowered a generation- the first "modern working woman" generation. good luck.</td>', 'I came back to this one to say its in my top 3- Its a bit sharpened but somehow it works with the black and whitish color scheme- great pose and send up to those world war two postcards which empowered a generation- the first "modern working woman" generation. good luck.', '2008-05-31 06:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735849, 682941, 12611, '<td valign="top">I gave this a nine originally, because of the expression and the pose. Great pet portrait. I guess an 8 is really where its at.</td>', 'I gave this a nine originally, because of the expression and the pose. Great pet portrait. I guess an 8 is really where its at.', '2008-05-31 06:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735851, 682621, 12611, '<td valign="top">There are a bunch of shots like this, but somehow the clarity, smoothness and expression go with the tones here. Its pretty close to a medal, and you may win, but compositionally I would probably zoom and crop it just above the eyebrows- the top of the head in the picture is unnnecesary. Good luck.</td>', 'There are a bunch of shots like this, but somehow the clarity, smoothness and expression go with the tones here. Its pretty close to a medal, and you may win, but compositionally I would probably zoom and crop it just above the eyebrows- the top of the head in the picture is unnnecesary. Good luck.', '2008-05-31 06:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735852, 682976, 12611, '<td valign="top">Just a really nice shot- Its got a coming of age suggestiveness, the title, the exposed skin- but the composition is really great- nice positioning and depth, subtle greens an dgreat trees behind her left shoulder. The bar on the right is distracting- but you can photoshop that out for the print after you win the medal. Good luck. (9)</td>', 'Just a really nice shot- Its got a coming of age suggestiveness, the title, the exposed skin- but the composition is really great- nice positioning and depth, subtle greens an dgreat trees behind her left shoulder. The bar on the right is distracting- but you can photoshop that out for the print after you win the medal. Good luck. (9)', '2008-05-31 06:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735853, 682201, 12611, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. Definitely a contender. Perhaps a bit more contrast with a spot of ultimate black. Really just a great shot- mesmerising how you get such a great and natural pose out of a such a young subject. Good luck with this one-</td>', 'Awesome shot. Definitely a contender. Perhaps a bit more contrast with a spot of ultimate black. Really just a great shot- mesmerising how you get such a great and natural pose out of a such a young subject. Good luck with this one-', '2008-05-31 06:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735855, 682903, 12611, '<td valign="top">Really good. Great focus. I love the interplay between religion and sexuality.(playfully biting the rosary while staring at the camera)- you can''t help but see a naughty nice contrast. A real contender.</td>', 'Really good. Great focus. I love the interplay between religion and sexuality.(playfully biting the rosary while staring at the camera)- you can''t help but see a naughty nice contrast. A real contender.', '2008-05-31 06:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735856, 681373, 12611, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Best pet shot I have seen in a while. Great title. two paws up.</td>', 'Fantastic. Best pet shot I have seen in a while. Great title. two paws up.', '2008-05-31 06:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735858, 682292, 12611, '<td valign="top">excellent compostion. A bit stark, cold- and although it does scream purity, the composition below the face could be a bit less busy. Still a contender. Great shot.</td>', 'excellent compostion. A bit stark, cold- and although it does scream purity, the composition below the face could be a bit less busy. Still a contender. Great shot.', '2008-05-31 06:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735860, 682009, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the pose and twinkle in the eye. Springtime is for love. But the colors somewhat suggest fall with the orange and the wheat, I can''t get past that- I thing spring, I think green. Nevertheless, a great entry.</td>', 'I love the pose and twinkle in the eye. Springtime is for love. But the colors somewhat suggest fall with the orange and the wheat, I can''t get past that- I thing spring, I think green. Nevertheless, a great entry.', '2008-05-31 06:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735862, 682765, 12611, '<td valign="top">I had to bump this higher, the expression is nice, and playful and the black and white contrast here is expertly done. The teeth and eye focal points are so nice and white- and just so much mascara. great shot. I hope this gets a ribbon.</td>', 'I had to bump this higher, the expression is nice, and playful and the black and white contrast here is expertly done. The teeth and eye focal points are so nice and white- and just so much mascara. great shot. I hope this gets a ribbon.', '2008-05-31 06:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735863, 682460, 12611, '<td valign="top">I think there are some issues with texture and contrast here- too much of the former and not enough of the latter.( especially above the head. A really beautiful, striking face- but I am lost in a see of woolly frazzle. Good luck</td>', 'I think there are some issues with texture and contrast here- too much of the former and not enough of the latter.( especially above the head. A really beautiful, striking face- but I am lost in a see of woolly frazzle. Good luck', '2008-05-31 06:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735865, 682448, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is a well composed shot. perfect lighting and warmth- a complete lack of enthusiasm on the part of the model. Super good. best of luck.</td>', 'This is a well composed shot. perfect lighting and warmth- a complete lack of enthusiasm on the part of the model. Super good. best of luck.', '2008-05-31 06:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735867, 681229, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the burned contrast here, The texture of the hair ends is great too. I think the titled view and cocky swagger of the subject can''t undo some of the flaws here. the picture lacks a bit of depth and the compostion looks like an after thought. GEt yourself in a studion because you have the talent to shoot out tens here. This one fall just short of that.</td>', 'I like the burned contrast here, The texture of the hair ends is great too. I think the titled view and cocky swagger of the subject can''t undo some of the flaws here. the picture lacks a bit of depth and the compostion looks like an after thought. GEt yourself in a studion because you have the talent to shoot out tens here. This one fall just short of that.', '2008-05-31 06:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735868, 682948, 12611, '<td valign="top">great emotion. nice lines. I will say that although I like the placement of the left hand, the white line up top draws the eye out of the picture. Great texture and contrast. the model deserves praise as well. acted out beautifully- a true blue contender</td>', 'great emotion. nice lines. I will say that although I like the placement of the left hand, the white line up top draws the eye out of the picture. Great texture and contrast. the model deserves praise as well. acted out beautifully- a true blue contender', '2008-05-31 06:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735869, 682969, 12611, '<td valign="top">Awesome expression- needs a bit more constrast- the lighting on the face is awesome- so is the chim cleft. Sweet entry- good luck.</td>', 'Awesome expression- needs a bit more constrast- the lighting on the face is awesome- so is the chim cleft. Sweet entry- good luck.', '2008-05-31 06:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
