(4735926, 681373, 93386, '<td valign="top">"My, what a big nose you have!" No, noone said the portrait had to be human. The swirls in the fur are great. You haven''t lost the detail with over exposure.</td>', '"My, what a big nose you have!" No, noone said the portrait had to be human. The swirls in the fur are great. You haven''t lost the detail with over exposure.', '2008-05-31 08:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
