(4735929, 682468, 93386, '<td valign="top">Smooth skin tones, nice expression. Woolly hat and leather jacket - nice contrast in textures. A really pleasant photograph. The hand is a little out of focus.</td>', 'Smooth skin tones, nice expression. Woolly hat and leather jacket - nice contrast in textures. A really pleasant photograph. The hand is a little out of focus.', '2008-05-31 08:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735938, 682889, 30982, '<td valign="top">The expression is simply priceless.  Add to that the crooked/broken front tooth and the bandaid on her thumb, and I''m quite sure she did whatever it is she said she didn''t.  Great shot, wonderful portrait - good luck!</td>', 'The expression is simply priceless.  Add to that the crooked/broken front tooth and the bandaid on her thumb, and I''m quite sure she did whatever it is she said she didn''t.  Great shot, wonderful portrait - good luck!', '2008-05-31 08:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735939, 682923, 30982, '<td valign="top">There are those that will think all portraits must be studio-created, with plain or controlled backgrounds and carefully positioned lights.  I''m not one of them.  I think this is dead-on for a portrait challenge.  Lovely composition, great smile.</td>', 'There are those that will think all portraits must be studio-created, with plain or controlled backgrounds and carefully positioned lights.  I''m not one of them.  I think this is dead-on for a portrait challenge.  Lovely composition, great smile.', '2008-05-31 08:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
