(4735941, 682351, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in this challenge - very warm, very inviting, great smiles.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in this challenge - very warm, very inviting, great smiles.', '2008-05-31 08:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735943, 682051, 30982, '<td valign="top">I hope this is doing well - this is very real, very good - I get the impression she''s a friendly, warm person, someone you''d be pleased to know.  And she looks awesome, 40-something or not.</td>', 'I hope this is doing well - this is very real, very good - I get the impression she''s a friendly, warm person, someone you''d be pleased to know.  And she looks awesome, 40-something or not.', '2008-05-31 08:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735944, 682948, 30982, '<td valign="top">Your choice of location is excellent, and the expression makes one wonder what she''s thinking/feeling.  Very strong portrait.</td>', 'Your choice of location is excellent, and the expression makes one wonder what she''s thinking/feeling.  Very strong portrait.', '2008-05-31 09:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735945, 681392, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this - the way you''ve placed her in the frame gives it a nice balance, good energy.  She has a delightfully warm and engaging smile.  Great job with light in the eyes, and I love that torn knee in the jeans - definitely adds a tomboy aspect.  The only criticism I''d offer is the tones seem a little on the yellow side.  That said, it''s still one of my favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'I love the composition of this - the way you''ve placed her in the frame gives it a nice balance, good energy.  She has a delightfully warm and engaging smile.  Great job with light in the eyes, and I love that torn knee in the jeans - definitely adds a tomboy aspect.  The only criticism I''d offer is the tones seem a little on the yellow side.  That said, it''s still one of my favorites for this challenge.', '2008-05-31 09:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735946, 682152, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit too casual for what most consider a "portrait" - more of a candid?  I think having the cup hide half her face does tend to detract as well.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit too casual for what most consider a "portrait" - more of a candid?  I think having the cup hide half her face does tend to detract as well.', '2008-05-31 09:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
