(4735949, 681049, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely girl, good setting.  Unfotunately the processing does detract from this for me.  Either there''s a texture or something in the processing created some pixelization.</td>', 'A lovely girl, good setting.  Unfotunately the processing does detract from this for me.  Either there''s a texture or something in the processing created some pixelization.', '2008-05-31 09:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
