(4736508, 682522, 93386, '<td valign="top">Taken from a low angle as if taken by her grandchild. S/he must be an incredibly skilled child! The lens choice is perfect (a fast lens?) The background is nicely out of focus.</td>', 'Taken from a low angle as if taken by her grandchild. S/he must be an incredibly skilled child! The lens choice is perfect (a fast lens?) The background is nicely out of focus.', '2008-05-31 18:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4736509, 681356, 10818, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bride, great pose and eye contact.  Photo really brings out her beautiful skin colors.</td>', 'Beautiful bride, great pose and eye contact.  Photo really brings out her beautiful skin colors.', '2008-05-31 18:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4736511, 682703, 93386, '<td valign="top">Her husband is hugh!!! Her expression is captured beautifully.</td>', 'Her husband is hugh!!! Her expression is captured beautifully.', '2008-05-31 18:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4736514, 682943, 93386, '<td valign="top">Might possibly work even better if it was a full length portrait.</td>', 'Might possibly work even better if it was a full length portrait.', '2008-05-31 18:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4736521, 681426, 93386, '<td valign="top">Health and Safety would have words - no hard-hat!! Somehow I want the contrast between the feminine model and the masculine tools to be greater. Maybe the clothes to be feminine clothes instead of work clothes. Also I like lots of contrast in black and white photography which always has to be added/increased.</td>', 'Health and Safety would have words - no hard-hat!! Somehow I want the contrast between the feminine model and the masculine tools to be greater. Maybe the clothes to be feminine clothes instead of work clothes. Also I like lots of contrast in black and white photography which always has to be added/increased.', '2008-05-31 18:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4736532, 682441, 93386, '<td valign="top">I find this a very attractive image. It is kind of low-fi. Lots of flare and the shadows have gone blue. The girl is attractive and the square format of the picture is really tastefully chosen.</td>', 'I find this a very attractive image. It is kind of low-fi. Lots of flare and the shadows have gone blue. The girl is attractive and the square format of the picture is really tastefully chosen.', '2008-05-31 18:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4736535, 682941, 93386, '<td valign="top">I think this capture is very funny. It is great! She is looking sideways which is quite unusual. You can see the white of her eye. The green grass is reflecting to fill in the shadows with colour.</td>', 'I think this capture is very funny. It is great! She is looking sideways which is quite unusual. You can see the white of her eye. The green grass is reflecting to fill in the shadows with colour.', '2008-05-31 19:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4736548, 682948, 93386, '<td valign="top">You have retained detail in both the dark background and the white dress. The diagonal white lines are striking. Great composition.</td>', 'You have retained detail in both the dark background and the white dress. The diagonal white lines are striking. Great composition.', '2008-05-31 19:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
