(4739305, 682029, 93765, '<td valign="top">Idea, model, pose, expression, crop :) <br/>Lighting :( <br/>I hope you get some good advice from people who know their ropes - I''m still in the trial-and-error phase myself, as far as lighting goes, just about able to spot a problem when I see it, but not confident in how to deal with it.<br/>I find your portrait above average as is, but nowhere near its ultimate potential.</td>', 'Idea, model, pose, expression, crop :) Lighting :( I hope you get some good advice from people who know their ropes - I''m still in the trial-and-error phase myself, as far as lighting goes, just about able to spot a problem when I see it, but not confident in how to deal with it.I find your portrait above average as is, but nowhere near its ultimate potential.', '2008-06-01 17:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
