(4739314, 681080, 93765, '<td valign="top">Fitting title, goes for the model as well as for the portrait. One of my favourites.</td>', 'Fitting title, goes for the model as well as for the portrait. One of my favourites.', '2008-06-01 17:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4739358, 682468, 8643, '<td valign="top">If you had managed both eyes like her left (viewer''s right) this would have been a sure fire winner!</td>', 'If you had managed both eyes like her left (viewer''s right) this would have been a sure fire winner!', '2008-06-01 17:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4739363, 682274, 8643, '<td valign="top">I like this but a closer crop would improve for me.</td>', 'I like this but a closer crop would improve for me.', '2008-06-01 17:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4739372, 682935, 8643, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, tells a good story.  Great use of DoF.</td>', 'Nice shot, tells a good story.  Great use of DoF.', '2008-06-01 17:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4739375, 682764, 93765, '<td valign="top">I''m on thin ice here, but I would say that this has too much of a snapshot to really work as a portrait. Technically it is quite good (apart from the background), but I would have wanted eye contact with the model. Given that, this could have been really good.<br/>A portrait without eye contact would only work, I think, if it was part of the story told. A picture of someone following some action that I am not aware of or "part of" ends up a snapshot. (I''ve got a whole bunch of them myself, and none of them is any good...)</td>', 'I''m on thin ice here, but I would say that this has too much of a snapshot to really work as a portrait. Technically it is quite good (apart from the background), but I would have wanted eye contact with the model. Given that, this could have been really good.A portrait without eye contact would only work, I think, if it was part of the story told. A picture of someone following some action that I am not aware of or "part of" ends up a snapshot. (I''ve got a whole bunch of them myself, and none of them is any good...)', '2008-06-01 17:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4739407, 681969, 93765, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the light from straight above really works. A bit further back, to just light up the hair and not the face, or to the front (but further away), to take care of the shadow from the nose. (But I''m not really competent to offer advice, just thinking about what I might have tried...)</td>', 'I don''t think the light from straight above really works. A bit further back, to just light up the hair and not the face, or to the front (but further away), to take care of the shadow from the nose. (But I''m not really competent to offer advice, just thinking about what I might have tried...)', '2008-06-01 18:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4739510, 682460, 93765, '<td valign="top">Perfect. I bet you were happy when you first saw it, and you had every reason to be!</td>', 'Perfect. I bet you were happy when you first saw it, and you had every reason to be!', '2008-06-01 18:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4739558, 682473, 93765, '<td valign="top">A true zap-stopper. Every picture may tell a story, but this one is special, in that it tells the viewer''s own story as well. Really powerful. Really disturbing. I''m grateful to have seen it.</td>', 'A true zap-stopper. Every picture may tell a story, but this one is special, in that it tells the viewer''s own story as well. Really powerful. Really disturbing. I''m grateful to have seen it.', '2008-06-01 19:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4739616, 681814, 89774, '<td valign="top">Love the expression and overall feel - joint first place for me. Awesome shot!</td>', 'Love the expression and overall feel - joint first place for me. Awesome shot!', '2008-06-01 19:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4739621, 682932, 89774, '<td valign="top">This is my preference for depth of field. Love the colors too. Joint first place for me. Well done!</td>', 'This is my preference for depth of field. Love the colors too. Joint first place for me. Well done!', '2008-06-01 19:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
