(4740020, 682351, 41675, '<td valign="top">Overall I like your image. The border is a bit too thick and makes your image seem..."boxed/squished" (Sorry, I''m not good with the technical stuff). Also, for me, I would have scored it a point higher if there was a bit more contrast as the grays seem a little flat.</td>', 'Overall I like your image. The border is a bit too thick and makes your image seem..."boxed/squished" (Sorry, I''m not good with the technical stuff). Also, for me, I would have scored it a point higher if there was a bit more contrast as the grays seem a little flat.', '2008-06-01 22:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4740025, 682441, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing. My initial thought was that it reminded me of faded high school portraits my parents keep on the walls 30 years later. Your photo has that retro kind of feel to it for me.</td>', 'Interesting processing. My initial thought was that it reminded me of faded high school portraits my parents keep on the walls 30 years later. Your photo has that retro kind of feel to it for me.', '2008-06-01 22:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4740027, 681169, 41675, '<td valign="top">I really like your photo. The red jacket, blue jeans and green foliage all provide a good contrast and don''t fight one another. I also like the lighting and her expression. I hope this does well in the challenge for you.</td>', 'I really like your photo. The red jacket, blue jeans and green foliage all provide a good contrast and don''t fight one another. I also like the lighting and her expression. I hope this does well in the challenge for you.', '2008-06-01 22:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4740031, 682853, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition as far as her placement in your image. I do wish she were looking up or at the camera though. My eyes look at her eyes and then right out of the photo.</td>', 'I like the composition as far as her placement in your image. I do wish she were looking up or at the camera though. My eyes look at her eyes and then right out of the photo.', '2008-06-01 22:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
