(4740277, 682895, 39427, '<td valign="top">cute but blurry!  I realize it might be intentional, but the hairs over the arm are in focus and that sort of detracts from the feel</td>', 'cute but blurry!  I realize it might be intentional, but the hairs over the arm are in focus and that sort of detracts from the feel', '2008-06-01 23:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4740278, 682728, 39427, '<td valign="top">nice looking professional shot</td>', 'nice looking professional shot', '2008-06-01 23:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4740354, 682886, 76430, '<td valign="top">Cute baby.  It''s unfortunate the fingers and foot are cut off.  It''s usually better to take a wider picture and crop as needed than to crop off an appendage.</td>', 'Cute baby.  It''s unfortunate the fingers and foot are cut off.  It''s usually better to take a wider picture and crop as needed than to crop off an appendage.', '2008-06-02 00:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4740360, 682968, 54645, '<td valign="top">This is a good image, love the mood. I tried many times to capture this, congratulations. I think the image needs more contrast, the mother is flat, and the unfortunate visual focal point is the blown out clothing/blanket. As ponder it more, I would love to see a tighter crop cutting out all or some the clothing. Just some thoughts! 7 for the emotion that you captured.</td>', 'This is a good image, love the mood. I tried many times to capture this, congratulations. I think the image needs more contrast, the mother is flat, and the unfortunate visual focal point is the blown out clothing/blanket. As ponder it more, I would love to see a tighter crop cutting out all or some the clothing. Just some thoughts! 7 for the emotion that you captured.', '2008-06-02 00:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4740390, 681373, 76430, '<td valign="top">I won''t mark you down for not having a human, but it''s not much of a portrait, since it''s basically a nose shot since it''s taken so close with the upturned nose.  I''d recommend moving back and wait ''til the bitch looks at the camera.</td>', 'I won''t mark you down for not having a human, but it''s not much of a portrait, since it''s basically a nose shot since it''s taken so close with the upturned nose.  I''d recommend moving back and wait ''til the bitch looks at the camera.', '2008-06-02 00:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4740425, 681190, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and soft focus.</td>', 'Nice composition and soft focus.', '2008-06-02 00:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4740441, 682941, 76430, '<td valign="top">Extra point for being a <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=650836" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">dachshund</a></td>', 'Extra point for being a dachshund', '2008-06-02 00:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4740557, 682218, 73056, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable eyes. Totally in your face. I feel like she''s in the room with me, ready to start a conversation. Nice processing and unique portrait.</td>', 'Unbelievable eyes. Totally in your face. I feel like she''s in the room with me, ready to start a conversation. Nice processing and unique portrait.', '2008-06-02 01:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
