(4742149, 682948, 58691, '<td valign="top">The wall to the left of the model adds excellent (and needed) texture to the image. I like how that section is framed by the grey/white slanted lines. Exposure on the model is outstanding and her painful/sorrowful expression really fits the image. Her outstretched arm intruding through the blackness creates a nice bridge from the abyss to the tactile. Well done.</td>', 'The wall to the left of the model adds excellent (and needed) texture to the image. I like how that section is framed by the grey/white slanted lines. Exposure on the model is outstanding and her painful/sorrowful expression really fits the image. Her outstretched arm intruding through the blackness creates a nice bridge from the abyss to the tactile. Well done.', '2008-06-02 14:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4742162, 682927, 59562, '<td valign="top">Cute.....:  )</td>', 'Cute.....:  )', '2008-06-02 14:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4742174, 682587, 58691, '<td valign="top">The dark - light progression is good, but the glare (and dirtiness of the glass)to the right of her face impedes the soft flow of the image. Realizing this is a basic editing challenge this is well done. This captures the sadness of saying goodbye very well - as though the darkness will overtake her as the train proceeds from the station.</td>', 'The dark - light progression is good, but the glare (and dirtiness of the glass)to the right of her face impedes the soft flow of the image. Realizing this is a basic editing challenge this is well done. This captures the sadness of saying goodbye very well - as though the darkness will overtake her as the train proceeds from the station.', '2008-06-02 14:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4742200, 682745, 58691, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure on the dark end of the spectrum and the focus is good. The portrait is void of any highlight, other than the lightest part of her hair. A soft light to brighten her eyes and lighten them would help this image. Also, it appears to be a little overly sharpened adding texture to her face.</td>', 'Excellent exposure on the dark end of the spectrum and the focus is good. The portrait is void of any highlight, other than the lightest part of her hair. A soft light to brighten her eyes and lighten them would help this image. Also, it appears to be a little overly sharpened adding texture to her face.', '2008-06-02 14:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4742233, 682899, 58691, '<td valign="top">The exposure is excellent - you were able to capture the many colors of her hair. This image appears to be overly sharpened (on her hair). Good DOF use as her face stands out nicely. The whites of the eyes look a bit odd (color/brightness) in relation to the rest of the image. Nice pose and adorable smile.</td>', 'The exposure is excellent - you were able to capture the many colors of her hair. This image appears to be overly sharpened (on her hair). Good DOF use as her face stands out nicely. The whites of the eyes look a bit odd (color/brightness) in relation to the rest of the image. Nice pose and adorable smile.', '2008-06-02 14:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
