(4743525, 682841, 52336, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait.  I like your composition, and the background and environment really work for me, but the best part of this is the particular mood captured on her face.  It looks reflective, somehow sad, maybe introverted.... probably the exact opposite of what this person is actually like, but the setting, and the capture of her hair in the slight breeze, revealing her face and neck, and the beautiful endless field of grass, really makes this special for me.  A great portrait, and one of my top three picks. 8</td>', 'This is a great portrait.  I like your composition, and the background and environment really work for me, but the best part of this is the particular mood captured on her face.  It looks reflective, somehow sad, maybe introverted.... probably the exact opposite of what this person is actually like, but the setting, and the capture of her hair in the slight breeze, revealing her face and neck, and the beautiful endless field of grass, really makes this special for me.  A great portrait, and one of my top three picks. 8', '2008-06-02 22:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4743526, 682292, 52336, '<td valign="top">Lovely depth of field.  A beautiful portrait.</td>', 'Lovely depth of field.  A beautiful portrait.', '2008-06-02 22:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4743533, 682346, 59562, '<td valign="top">Smooth and lovely.....: )</td>', 'Smooth and lovely.....: )', '2008-06-02 22:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4743539, 681818, 52336, '<td valign="top">The best of the portraits of young girls in the challenge.  The natural light makes this quite beautiful.  Would a tighter crop, eliminating some of the top, helped too?  I don''t know. 7</td>', 'The best of the portraits of young girls in the challenge.  The natural light makes this quite beautiful.  Would a tighter crop, eliminating some of the top, helped too?  I don''t know. 7', '2008-06-02 22:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4743588, 682965, 59562, '<td valign="top">Superb....:  )</td>', 'Superb....:  )', '2008-06-02 23:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4743667, 682201, 59562, '<td valign="top">Sweet....:  )</td>', 'Sweet....:  )', '2008-06-02 23:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4743956, 682519, 7485, '<td valign="top">This has a very classical quality to it, almost like something Weston or Cunningham might have done</td>', 'This has a very classical quality to it, almost like something Weston or Cunningham might have done', '2008-06-03 00:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4743958, 682450, 7485, '<td valign="top">Unusual expression, great use of color (with her eyes matching the water), all in all a keeper!</td>', 'Unusual expression, great use of color (with her eyes matching the water), all in all a keeper!', '2008-06-03 00:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4743961, 682903, 7485, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous skin texture!</td>', 'Gorgeous skin texture!', '2008-06-03 00:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744356, 681964, 75919, '<td valign="top">This is a standout portrait for me.  Composition, color &amp; focus are great - plus I might be influenced by the beauty of the subject!</td>', 'This is a standout portrait for me.  Composition, color & focus are great - plus I might be influenced by the beauty of the subject!', '2008-06-03 05:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744358, 681080, 75919, '<td valign="top">Really appealing portrait.  Overexposure on face flatters subject but removes some character.</td>', 'Really appealing portrait.  Overexposure on face flatters subject but removes some character.', '2008-06-03 05:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744360, 682391, 75919, '<td valign="top">Very appealing.  Like the lighting &amp; framing plus personality shines thru</td>', 'Very appealing.  Like the lighting & framing plus personality shines thru', '2008-06-03 05:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744361, 682903, 75919, '<td valign="top">I originally rated this lower - but it works so well as a portrait, she''s right here</td>', 'I originally rated this lower - but it works so well as a portrait, she''s right here', '2008-06-03 05:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744362, 682968, 75919, '<td valign="top">Beautiful balance, touching all the emotional buttons</td>', 'Beautiful balance, touching all the emotional buttons', '2008-06-03 05:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744364, 682119, 75919, '<td valign="top">Composition, lighting, pose all do justice to a beautiful subject</td>', 'Composition, lighting, pose all do justice to a beautiful subject', '2008-06-03 05:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744371, 681072, 75919, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like photos of children, unformed faces lack character &amp; really appeal most to parents, but I like this composition centred on the one clear eye &amp; showing personality.</td>', 'I don''t really like photos of children, unformed faces lack character & really appeal most to parents, but I like this composition centred on the one clear eye & showing personality.', '2008-06-03 05:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744374, 682460, 75919, '<td valign="top">I''m really drawn to this portrait - even tho the eyes &amp; face seem less focussed than the wrap</td>', 'I''m really drawn to this portrait - even tho the eyes & face seem less focussed than the wrap', '2008-06-03 05:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744378, 682519, 75919, '<td valign="top">A gentle, lyrical shot - but I keep trying to brush that one hair off the screen!</td>', 'A gentle, lyrical shot - but I keep trying to brush that one hair off the screen!', '2008-06-03 05:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744382, 682614, 75919, '<td valign="top">I like this because it shows the person, &amp; the off-cntre composition draws attention to the face &amp; eyes</td>', 'I like this because it shows the person, & the off-cntre composition draws attention to the face & eyes', '2008-06-03 05:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744384, 682000, 75919, '<td valign="top">Good focus, colors, comp &amp; emotion</td>', 'Good focus, colors, comp & emotion', '2008-06-03 05:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744389, 682965, 50034, '<td valign="top">Very artistic lighting!  I like it very much!  Could be an easy transition from photo to painting...Great work!  10 from me!  :)</td>', 'Very artistic lighting!  I like it very much!  Could be an easy transition from photo to painting...Great work!  10 from me!  :)', '2008-06-03 05:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744390, 682249, 75919, '<td valign="top">not really a portrait, also confusing &amp; unclear</td>', 'not really a portrait, also confusing & unclear', '2008-06-03 05:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744391, 681373, 75919, '<td valign="top">right - but as a portrait it doesn''t work for me!</td>', 'right - but as a portrait it doesn''t work for me!', '2008-06-03 05:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744394, 682890, 50034, '<td valign="top">Interesting tilt &amp; portrait of an apparently statuesque lady...Great work!  The tilt could be debatable, but I am sure that you had your reasons, like leaning forward to indicate excitement at being "Ready to go!"  :)  Nice in black &amp; white... :)</td>', 'Interesting tilt & portrait of an apparently statuesque lady...Great work!  The tilt could be debatable, but I am sure that you had your reasons, like leaning forward to indicate excitement at being "Ready to go!"  :)  Nice in black & white... :)', '2008-06-03 05:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744396, 682939, 50034, '<td valign="top">Sweet Smile...  :)</td>', 'Sweet Smile...  :)', '2008-06-03 05:48:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4744398, 682909, 75919, '<td valign="top">Nice try - but I think a portrait should focus on the face - could be sharper &amp; much closer</td>', 'Nice try - but I think a portrait should focus on the face - could be sharper & much closer', '2008-06-03 05:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744399, 682201, 50034, '<td valign="top">Sweet little girl...the background reflections in her eyes make for a near starburst-effect.  Excellent!  I like this very much!  In she goes to favorites.  You ARE blessed!  :)  10 from me!  :)</td>', 'Sweet little girl...the background reflections in her eyes make for a near starburst-effect.  Excellent!  I like this very much!  In she goes to favorites.  You ARE blessed!  :)  10 from me!  :)', '2008-06-03 05:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744400, 680714, 75919, '<td valign="top">interesting idea - but for me a portrait should show more of the subject than the tree</td>', 'interesting idea - but for me a portrait should show more of the subject than the tree', '2008-06-03 05:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744401, 682841, 75919, '<td valign="top">nice soulful picture - but why not focus closer on the subject &amp; cut out the brown mass in the background?</td>', 'nice soulful picture - but why not focus closer on the subject & cut out the brown mass in the background?', '2008-06-03 05:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744402, 682971, 50034, '<td valign="top">The brightness of her hair, her make-up, and the glitter make me wonder if serious is her secondary skill while smiling is her primary benefit.  Strong lines between muscles just past the corners of her mouth tell me that she probably smiles a great deal...(Hope I''m right.)  :)</td>', 'The brightness of her hair, her make-up, and the glitter make me wonder if serious is her secondary skill while smiling is her primary benefit.  Strong lines between muscles just past the corners of her mouth tell me that she probably smiles a great deal...(Hope I''m right.)  :)', '2008-06-03 05:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744403, 681999, 50034, '<td valign="top">Agreed...I thought mischief...even though black &amp; white, I think that saturating this strongly and increasing the light (maybe a little increase in the contrast) could have improved the strength of the image.  I would personally like it a little brighter.  :)</td>', 'Agreed...I thought mischief...even though black & white, I think that saturating this strongly and increasing the light (maybe a little increase in the contrast) could have improved the strength of the image.  I would personally like it a little brighter.  :)', '2008-06-03 05:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744405, 682888, 50034, '<td valign="top">Excellent Portrait!  Blurred background with great rims from backlighting and great expression make this a wonderful picture of an impressive lady.  (As a fun side-note, her outfit makes me expect to see a tennis racket thrown over a shoulder.)  :)  Nice in black &amp; white!  :)</td>', 'Excellent Portrait!  Blurred background with great rims from backlighting and great expression make this a wonderful picture of an impressive lady.  (As a fun side-note, her outfit makes me expect to see a tennis racket thrown over a shoulder.)  :)  Nice in black & white!  :)', '2008-06-03 06:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744406, 682976, 50034, '<td valign="top">As to title, Is THAT possible?  :}  The repetition of strong black lines makes this appear almost a triptych (or whatever four panels would be called.)</td>', 'As to title, Is THAT possible?  :}  The repetition of strong black lines makes this appear almost a triptych (or whatever four panels would be called.)', '2008-06-03 06:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744408, 681392, 50034, '<td valign="top">Sweet!   Cute!  Great expression!  :)</td>', 'Sweet!   Cute!  Great expression!  :)', '2008-06-03 06:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744412, 681614, 50034, '<td valign="top">Been there!  Done that!  Living the sequel!  Great studio production (apparently) of an environmental portrait!  Great Work!  :)</td>', 'Been there!  Done that!  Living the sequel!  Great studio production (apparently) of an environmental portrait!  Great Work!  :)', '2008-06-03 06:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744415, 682586, 50034, '<td valign="top">Without doubt!  Definitely royal in any color!  Sweet face!  :)</td>', 'Without doubt!  Definitely royal in any color!  Sweet face!  :)', '2008-06-03 06:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744416, 681578, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great High-Key!  :)</td>', 'Great High-Key!  :)', '2008-06-03 06:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744418, 682012, 50034, '<td valign="top">Strong mood lighting!  Very artistic!  LIKE!  :)</td>', 'Strong mood lighting!  Very artistic!  LIKE!  :)', '2008-06-03 06:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744419, 682351, 50034, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  :)</td>', 'Sweet!  :)', '2008-06-03 06:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744423, 681818, 50034, '<td valign="top">Sweet Portrait!  I believe that a more simplified background could help this setting...as well as a crop tighter on the "head-room."  She does "serious" believably well.  :)</td>', 'Sweet Portrait!  I believe that a more simplified background could help this setting...as well as a crop tighter on the "head-room."  She does "serious" believably well.  :)', '2008-06-03 06:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744426, 681667, 50034, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  Precious little lady!  :)</td>', 'Sweet!  Precious little lady!  :)', '2008-06-03 06:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744428, 682119, 50034, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a strong, moody, artistic image!  Great rim lighting &amp; side placement of the main.  I like this very much!  Portrait make her look much older...in a good way.  :)</td>', 'Wow!  What a strong, moody, artistic image!  Great rim lighting & side placement of the main.  I like this very much!  Portrait make her look much older...in a good way.  :)', '2008-06-03 06:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744430, 681048, 50034, '<td valign="top">Tighter crop would improve this IMHO because the background is too complex &amp; too much pulling the eye away from the subjects.  (When I "hand-crop" just above her head, this is a very nice portrait.)  Hope that helps.  :)</td>', 'Tighter crop would improve this IMHO because the background is too complex & too much pulling the eye away from the subjects.  (When I "hand-crop" just above her head, this is a very nice portrait.)  Hope that helps.  :)', '2008-06-03 06:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744432, 682051, 50034, '<td valign="top">Excellent Smile!  :)</td>', 'Excellent Smile!  :)', '2008-06-03 06:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4744433, 682948, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines!  Appears to be Tilda Swinton as a model instead of the White witch in Chronicles of Narnia #1...  :)  (Certainly a compliment in my book...)  :)</td>', 'Nice leading lines!  Appears to be Tilda Swinton as a model instead of the White witch in Chronicles of Narnia #1...  :)  (Certainly a compliment in my book...)  :)', '2008-06-03 06:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
