(4746974, 681814, 60195, '<td valign="top">Hey Coley... congrats on the Top 10.  I had this in my top 3 (as commented during the challenge). <br/>ps. now that i know it''s <b><i>your daughter</i></b> - please disregard my earlier "seductive" comment.  Ooops! &lt;runs &amp; hides&gt; ;O)</td>', 'Hey Coley... congrats on the Top 10.  I had this in my top 3 (as commented during the challenge). ps. now that i know it''s your daughter - please disregard my earlier "seductive" comment.  Ooops! <runs & hides> ;O)', '2008-06-04 02:02:43.000000', NULL, 0),
