(4747286, 681964, 53316, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail is very simple and not with, for me, a lot of impact, but I knew there was going to be something special... and full size it just grabs me and doesn''t let me go!! I don''t know what it is about the image.. maybe the intense gaze coupled with the intense lighting.... in any case, you did a very wonderful job! Surprising that you did very little editing - it looks to me like you spent a long time getting things perfect!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-04 03:25:43.</i></td>', 'The thumbnail is very simple and not with, for me, a lot of impact, but I knew there was going to be something special... and full size it just grabs me and doesn''t let me go!! I don''t know what it is about the image.. maybe the intense gaze coupled with the intense lighting.... in any case, you did a very wonderful job! Surprising that you did very little editing - it looks to me like you spent a long time getting things perfect!', '2008-06-04 04:25:07.000000', '2008-06-04 04:25:43.000000', 0),
