(4747470, 682274, 67152, '<td valign="top">Jon,<br/> <br/>You know it is not fair to use a much better model than Charlene.  If you were doing some sort of a competition, you won by a mile on mere subject matter alone...<br/> <br/>Overall impression:<br/>She''s beautiful, your lucky, and she must be delusional...A perfect combination.<br/> <br/>Photographic impression:<br/>Really nice colors and use of the soft greens in the background to frame the subject.  The lighting on her face is warm and she seems very relaxed and comfortable.  I am not crazy about the crop - it seems a bit oddly placed.  A closer crop more on her face would really have dealt with some of the flaws that other commenters discussed below. <br/> <br/>I only gave it a 6 during voting due mostly to the pose and crop.<br/> <br/>post script:<br/>It is actually funny, but sitting here writing this made me think of the great Lyle Lovett song "Her First Mistake" - check it out if you haven''t heard it before - it just SOOOO fits you.<br/></td>', 'Jon, You know it is not fair to use a much better model than Charlene.  If you were doing some sort of a competition, you won by a mile on mere subject matter alone... Overall impression:She''s beautiful, your lucky, and she must be delusional...A perfect combination. Photographic impression:Really nice colors and use of the soft greens in the background to frame the subject.  The lighting on her face is warm and she seems very relaxed and comfortable.  I am not crazy about the crop - it seems a bit oddly placed.  A closer crop more on her face would really have dealt with some of the flaws that other commenters discussed below.  I only gave it a 6 during voting due mostly to the pose and crop. post script:It is actually funny, but sitting here writing this made me think of the great Lyle Lovett song "Her First Mistake" - check it out if you haven''t heard it before - it just SOOOO fits you.', '2008-06-04 06:32:47.000000', NULL, 0),
