(4747737, 682935, 67152, '<td valign="top">I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=43410" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jerowe</a> - this image is awesome and really provides us with a sense of her personality and passion.  Wonderful job.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jerowe:</b></div><hr/><i> I love this image, and think it should have placed so much higher, but you had a wonderful score.  You should take lots more pictures of her! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'I agree with  jerowe - this image is awesome and really provides us with a sense of her personality and passion.  Wonderful job. Originally posted by jerowe: I love this image, and think it should have placed so much higher, but you had a wonderful score.  You should take lots more pictures of her! ', '2008-06-04 09:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
