(4748429, 682460, 90387, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, so I saw this in the before and after side challenge.  Quite a striking image, and I think you made and excellent decision to conver to B&amp;W.  Crazy how from the thumbnail that scarf absolutely disappears!</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, so I saw this in the before and after side challenge.  Quite a striking image, and I think you made and excellent decision to conver to B&W.  Crazy how from the thumbnail that scarf absolutely disappears!', '2008-06-04 12:22:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748476, 682286, 52115, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I hear you''ll be showing some tips at the Calgary-CA, Seminar/GTG.</td>', 'Great shot, I hear you''ll be showing some tips at the Calgary-CA, Seminar/GTG.', '2008-06-04 12:36:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748481, 682688, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice, Terry. I like the close crop, the angle of the face, and the sharp focus. I find it quite hard to do a good portrait without spot editing, and I applaud the image you have achieved under the basic rules.</td>', 'Nice, Terry. I like the close crop, the angle of the face, and the sharp focus. I find it quite hard to do a good portrait without spot editing, and I applaud the image you have achieved under the basic rules.', '2008-06-04 12:37:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748506, 682573, 66384, '<td valign="top">Ha, I like your composition! You got it all in: reads the newspaper, participates in civic events, not focused on fashion and the superficial, of a certain age (as evidenced by the hands). This is a portrait of a whole segment of the American population rather than an individual. Time for an OOBie.</td>', 'Ha, I like your composition! You got it all in: reads the newspaper, participates in civic events, not focused on fashion and the superficial, of a certain age (as evidenced by the hands). This is a portrait of a whole segment of the American population rather than an individual. Time for an OOBie.', '2008-06-04 12:44:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748510, 681964, 6845, '<td valign="top">Hey MAK, way to go! Keep up the great work man!</td>', 'Hey MAK, way to go! Keep up the great work man!', '2008-06-04 12:45:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748525, 682973, 57060, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo and beautiful girl. Funny comments, one will critcize on say the light, the next will complement same point - just goes to show you can''t please everyone :~)<br/> <br/>I do agree about teh yellow cast though - even though the light looks like it i very warm, it does give the overall picture a yellow cast - at least on my monitor. Also agree on the comment re the reflector for the shadow. Still nice job, congrats on your score.</td>', 'Beautiful photo and beautiful girl. Funny comments, one will critcize on say the light, the next will complement same point - just goes to show you can''t please everyone :~) I do agree about teh yellow cast though - even though the light looks like it i very warm, it does give the overall picture a yellow cast - at least on my monitor. Also agree on the comment re the reflector for the shadow. Still nice job, congrats on your score.', '2008-06-04 12:49:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748537, 681964, 29011, '<td valign="top">A striking capture. Way to go team Mak and Hanae!<br/>If I where the betting type I''d say the odds where heavily in favor of this getting into the top3. Very well deserved. Great shot all around.  Congratulations :)</td>', 'A striking capture. Way to go team Mak and Hanae!If I where the betting type I''d say the odds where heavily in favor of this getting into the top3. Very well deserved. Great shot all around.  Congratulations :)', '2008-06-04 12:54:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748543, 682867, 66384, '<td valign="top">She''s a pretty girl and nice gentle expression. I like the soft lighting. I am distracted by what seems to be over-sharpening along the edge of her teeth, nose, and hair highlights.</td>', 'She''s a pretty girl and nice gentle expression. I like the soft lighting. I am distracted by what seems to be over-sharpening along the edge of her teeth, nose, and hair highlights.', '2008-06-04 12:55:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748545, 682286, 29011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, capture and model. I was hoping you''d have a shot for us in this challenge. Congratulations on the blue.</td>', 'Beautiful, capture and model. I was hoping you''d have a shot for us in this challenge. Congratulations on the blue.', '2008-06-04 12:55:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748551, 682319, 57060, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, generated a lot of comments as you can see. To me the biggest problem is the focus - the 85mm lens may just not have had the dof you needed, it appears that you focused on top of her head. I also don''t really care for the lighting too much, the overhead hair light just seems a bit too strong resulting in some shadows over her eyes. Still, as I said, an interesting and provocative shot, so I think it stands out in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting shot, generated a lot of comments as you can see. To me the biggest problem is the focus - the 85mm lens may just not have had the dof you needed, it appears that you focused on top of her head. I also don''t really care for the lighting too much, the overhead hair light just seems a bit too strong resulting in some shadows over her eyes. Still, as I said, an interesting and provocative shot, so I think it stands out in the challenge.', '2008-06-04 12:56:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748552, 682932, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really like the softness of the capture. Very delicate and pretty.<br/>Congratulations on the ribbon. Cheers!</td>', 'Really like the softness of the capture. Very delicate and pretty.Congratulations on the ribbon. Cheers!', '2008-06-04 12:56:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748562, 682441, 66384, '<td valign="top">Interesting experiment with the Vaseline. I like the blurred vignette. I wish the girl stood out more from the rest of the image. I would like to see her with more contrast, and smoother skin. Maybe not possible with basic editing, but might be worth reworking without that restriction. She''s a pretty girl and I love what you have done with the daisies.</td>', 'Interesting experiment with the Vaseline. I like the blurred vignette. I wish the girl stood out more from the rest of the image. I would like to see her with more contrast, and smoother skin. Maybe not possible with basic editing, but might be worth reworking without that restriction. She''s a pretty girl and I love what you have done with the daisies.', '2008-06-04 13:00:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748575, 681814, 29011, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully artistic and soulfull indeed. May be you folks get this a lot? Here your daughter reminds me a of a younger Jennifer Connelly.</td>', 'Wonderfully artistic and soulfull indeed. May be you folks get this a lot? Here your daughter reminds me a of a younger Jennifer Connelly.', '2008-06-04 13:03:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748579, 682579, 66384, '<td valign="top">She is beautiful and does look addictive. I wish the light was better on her face. Certainly is hard to do do a good portrait in dappled light. The bright background behind her head keeps pulling my attention away from that wonderful face.</td>', 'She is beautiful and does look addictive. I wish the light was better on her face. Certainly is hard to do do a good portrait in dappled light. The bright background behind her head keeps pulling my attention away from that wonderful face.', '2008-06-04 13:05:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748700, 682319, 45115, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by alexjack:</b></div><hr/><i> Interesting shot, generated a lot of comments as you can see. To me the biggest problem is the focus - the 85mm lens may just not have had the dof you needed, it appears that you focused on top of her head. I also don''t really care for the lighting too much, the overhead hair light just seems a bit too strong resulting in some shadows over her eyes. Still, as I said, an interesting and provocative shot, so I think it stands out in the challenge. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>To you and all the comments bellow regarding the focus:<br/>I don''t see any problem with it. Additionally, I didn''t do it on the forehead but on her eyes. The focus came out exactly the way I wanted, sharp on her eyes / mouth and soft on her hair / ears.</td>', 'Originally posted by alexjack: Interesting shot, generated a lot of comments as you can see. To me the biggest problem is the focus - the 85mm lens may just not have had the dof you needed, it appears that you focused on top of her head. I also don''t really care for the lighting too much, the overhead hair light just seems a bit too strong resulting in some shadows over her eyes. Still, as I said, an interesting and provocative shot, so I think it stands out in the challenge.   To you and all the comments bellow regarding the focus:I don''t see any problem with it. Additionally, I didn''t do it on the forehead but on her eyes. The focus came out exactly the way I wanted, sharp on her eyes / mouth and soft on her hair / ears.', '2008-06-04 13:39:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748751, 682286, 7711, '<td valign="top">this shot is simply amazing. wow.</td>', 'this shot is simply amazing. wow.', '2008-06-04 13:50:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748818, 681814, 58516, '<td valign="top">now can you stop telling me not to watch my pizza cook? Look what it got you! ;):D</td>', 'now can you stop telling me not to watch my pizza cook? Look what it got you! ;):D', '2008-06-04 14:06:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748861, 682018, 39349, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot and from a fellow Utahan as well! Congrats on your 4th place and PB!</td>', 'This is a great shot and from a fellow Utahan as well! Congrats on your 4th place and PB!', '2008-06-04 14:17:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748872, 682903, 39349, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, I agree with your comments about keeping her face the focus and her body as a supporting element to the face. Wonderful composition and post work. Congrats to you and the model on this beautiful image.<br/></td>', 'Lovely portrait, I agree with your comments about keeping her face the focus and her body as a supporting element to the face. Wonderful composition and post work. Congrats to you and the model on this beautiful image.', '2008-06-04 14:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748878, 682201, 39349, '<td valign="top">This is SO good, composition, b/w post work and those eyes! Well done and congrats to you on this great image.</td>', 'This is SO good, composition, b/w post work and those eyes! Well done and congrats to you on this great image.', '2008-06-04 14:20:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748879, 682573, 50695, '<td valign="top">Commie pinko!</td>', 'Commie pinko!', '2008-06-04 14:21:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748883, 682968, 39349, '<td valign="top">This really is a great image, and by great I mean AMAZINGLY GOOD! It really captures emotion and love. Well done.</td>', 'This really is a great image, and by great I mean AMAZINGLY GOOD! It really captures emotion and love. Well done.', '2008-06-04 14:22:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748906, 681814, 39349, '<td valign="top">What a great candid. Your post work is spot on and the composition works well. Kids are amazing and it''s cool that your daughter shares in the craziness that is photography. I know my boys sure put up with a lot from their old man. Congrats on your top 10 with this honest and beautiful image.<br/></td>', 'What a great candid. Your post work is spot on and the composition works well. Kids are amazing and it''s cool that your daughter shares in the craziness that is photography. I know my boys sure put up with a lot from their old man. Congrats on your top 10 with this honest and beautiful image.', '2008-06-04 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748975, 682274, 49954, '<td valign="top">Did this one get validated?  I voted as if valid, but it still looks like Advanced editing was used -- There are areas around her body where the background still looks sharp and in focus -- as if the blur tool was used.</td>', 'Did this one get validated?  I voted as if valid, but it still looks like Advanced editing was used -- There are areas around her body where the background still looks sharp and in focus -- as if the blur tool was used.', '2008-06-04 14:41:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748982, 682286, 3746, '<td valign="top">Perfect shot, deserving of the blue..</td>', 'Perfect shot, deserving of the blue..', '2008-06-04 14:46:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748989, 681964, 3746, '<td valign="top">I think SC really need to look into who gave this a 1,2 or 3... I know everyone has their own opinions, but jeez, not only does this nail the challenge (duh!) but the use of colour and lighting is top notch... Could easily pass for a Librodo shot. <br/> <br/>I would so love to know who voted this down, gutless little fuckwads that they are.. nice one MAK, you deserve it with this shot.</td>', 'I think SC really need to look into who gave this a 1,2 or 3... I know everyone has their own opinions, but jeez, not only does this nail the challenge (duh!) but the use of colour and lighting is top notch... Could easily pass for a Librodo shot.  I would so love to know who voted this down, gutless little fuckwads that they are.. nice one MAK, you deserve it with this shot.', '2008-06-04 14:48:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748991, 682932, 3746, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot, inspires me to brush up on my portrait photography.</td>', 'Brilliant shot, inspires me to brush up on my portrait photography.', '2008-06-04 14:49:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4749011, 682935, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m so happy this did well and that it has its fans.  In a field of extreme closeups and fierce or somber expressions (many of which I liked very much, btw), this environmental portrait was like a breath of fresh air.  I love your wife''s warm, contented expression.  Oh yeah, watch your spelling, especially in a title! ;-)</td>', 'I''m so happy this did well and that it has its fans.  In a field of extreme closeups and fierce or somber expressions (many of which I liked very much, btw), this environmental portrait was like a breath of fresh air.  I love your wife''s warm, contented expression.  Oh yeah, watch your spelling, especially in a title! ;-)', '2008-06-04 14:59:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4749019, 682286, 7889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MikeOwens:</b></div><hr/><i> Excellent image, I would expect this to ribbon, good luck </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>:-)  Congratulations !<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by MikeOwens: Excellent image, I would expect this to ribbon, good luck   :-)  Congratulations ! ', '2008-06-04 15:02:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4749034, 681964, 7889, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Mak, excellent image, cant really fault it.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations Mak, excellent image, cant really fault it. ', '2008-06-04 15:07:39.000000', NULL, 0),
