(4749686, 681048, 76430, '<td valign="top">Wow, all the comments and almost 100% mentioned cropping out the top.  I guess that thought will stick with you.  They''re both very cute.</td>', 'Wow, all the comments and almost 100% mentioned cropping out the top.  I guess that thought will stick with you.  They''re both very cute.', '2008-06-04 19:45:40.000000', NULL, 0),
