(4750323, 682201, 94278, '<td valign="top">What a cute smile. Skin looks a bit overexposed but works very well in this image. Gives the look and feel of a little angel. VERY nice photo.</td>', 'What a cute smile. Skin looks a bit overexposed but works very well in this image. Gives the look and feel of a little angel. VERY nice photo.', '2008-06-04 23:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750442, 682941, 20324, '<td valign="top">Nice feminine looking dachshund.  Looks like she is a little bit camera shy (like most known to me females). It is definitively a female portrait IMO. Where did it say that it has to be a human female? Some commenters seem to have a hard time thinking  out of their empty boxes.</td>', 'Nice feminine looking dachshund.  Looks like she is a little bit camera shy (like most known to me females). It is definitively a female portrait IMO. Where did it say that it has to be a human female? Some commenters seem to have a hard time thinking  out of their empty boxes.', '2008-06-05 00:16:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750508, 682201, 54645, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Rgrat:</b></div><hr/><i> What a cute smile. Skin looks a bit overexposed but works very well in this image. Gives the look and feel of a little angel. VERY nice photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, I agree, the skin does look overexposed. It''s actually the result of slight bump in brightness at the end of the PP to soften the look and to adjust a print version. Thanks for the comment, she definitely is an angel who loves to be photographed.</td>', 'Originally posted by Rgrat: What a cute smile. Skin looks a bit overexposed but works very well in this image. Gives the look and feel of a little angel. VERY nice photo.   Yes, I agree, the skin does look overexposed. It''s actually the result of slight bump in brightness at the end of the PP to soften the look and to adjust a print version. Thanks for the comment, she definitely is an angel who loves to be photographed.', '2008-06-05 00:38:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750553, 682460, 70375, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most amazing changes I have ever seen. If you haven''t done it yourself yet, flip back and forth really fast :) hehe SWEET edit</td>', 'This is one of the most amazing changes I have ever seen. If you haven''t done it yourself yet, flip back and forth really fast :) hehe SWEET edit', '2008-06-05 00:48:49.000000', NULL, 0),
