(4754488, 682286, 90947, '<td valign="top">I just looked at this image again and found that I may have underscored it.  I only gave it a 9.  In my second viewing the fact the model is a cute freckled faced girl captured me.  The juxtaposition of the innocence connoted by the freckles and the dripping sultriness of the rest of the image really pushes this over the top for me.</td>', 'I just looked at this image again and found that I may have underscored it.  I only gave it a 9.  In my second viewing the fact the model is a cute freckled faced girl captured me.  The juxtaposition of the innocence connoted by the freckles and the dripping sultriness of the rest of the image really pushes this over the top for me.', '2008-06-06 16:12:05.000000', NULL, 0),
