(4754805, 682319, 33535, '<td valign="top">hey man, you got robbed here. i don''t really care for most of the top 10 shots in this challenge, because many of them don''t show character. your''s does and it also shows an attitude. i agree with some comments tho that the eyes are a tad soft and need a catchlight, but otherwise it''s nicely done and should of deserved top 10. <br/>greets :) chris</td>', 'hey man, you got robbed here. i don''t really care for most of the top 10 shots in this challenge, because many of them don''t show character. your''s does and it also shows an attitude. i agree with some comments tho that the eyes are a tad soft and need a catchlight, but otherwise it''s nicely done and should of deserved top 10. greets :) chris', '2008-06-06 19:32:41.000000', NULL, 0),
