(4755068, 682923, 92462, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  When I saw the first pic I thought to myself ''She needs a top hat!''  Which, I see she has!  The model and the photos do the character amazing justice.  its a shame you never read the sandman or the spin offs featuring Death, it might have helped with your title, which I agree, is lacking.  Maybe something like ''A date with her will cost you 2 cents'' although that is a little long... ;)<br/> <br/>Anyway, Gratz on top 10!  You should try doing a series featuring her other siblings.</td>', 'Awesome!  When I saw the first pic I thought to myself ''She needs a top hat!''  Which, I see she has!  The model and the photos do the character amazing justice.  its a shame you never read the sandman or the spin offs featuring Death, it might have helped with your title, which I agree, is lacking.  Maybe something like ''A date with her will cost you 2 cents'' although that is a little long... ;) Anyway, Gratz on top 10!  You should try doing a series featuring her other siblings.', '2008-06-06 23:37:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4755225, 682766, 65468, '<td valign="top">I agree with Camabs''s comment, you did choose the better image but wish your hair was as well lighted as the other image.  The even lighting over the full length of your body was well done for this kind of an angle.  Beautiful but discreet pose.</td>', 'I agree with Camabs''s comment, you did choose the better image but wish your hair was as well lighted as the other image.  The even lighting over the full length of your body was well done for this kind of an angle.  Beautiful but discreet pose.', '2008-06-07 01:36:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4755272, 682274, 70514, '<td valign="top">I can hardly comment on this, I''m so sorry, but I''ll give it a go.  <br/> <br/>I love the vibrant colors, the softness of the image (gotta love Neat image) and the emotion captured.  <br/> <br/>Thank you, you always make me look so pretty.<br/> <br/>C.</td>', 'I can hardly comment on this, I''m so sorry, but I''ll give it a go.   I love the vibrant colors, the softness of the image (gotta love Neat image) and the emotion captured.   Thank you, you always make me look so pretty. C.', '2008-06-07 02:14:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4755384, 682968, 87278, '<td valign="top">Very expressive</td>', 'Very expressive', '2008-06-07 04:49:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4755393, 682969, 87278, '<td valign="top">The sharp features are captured nicely. The quintessential of female portraiture - angles, curves, expression, ornaments/accessories?, mood, fashion - all captured. May be the right side of the subject shd hv been a little more hidden in darkness to enhance the mystery of the female aura.<br/> <br/>(oops! when i look below at what the experts say in the comments, I guess I am saying the opposite - they are calling for more light on the right! But then I am no photographer - so I am leaving my honest opinion as is for whatever it is worth.)<br/> <br/>Congratulations on  your maiden attempt. I guess you wd strike it rich sometime soon!</td>', 'The sharp features are captured nicely. The quintessential of female portraiture - angles, curves, expression, ornaments/accessories?, mood, fashion - all captured. May be the right side of the subject shd hv been a little more hidden in darkness to enhance the mystery of the female aura. (oops! when i look below at what the experts say in the comments, I guess I am saying the opposite - they are calling for more light on the right! But then I am no photographer - so I am leaving my honest opinion as is for whatever it is worth.) Congratulations on  your maiden attempt. I guess you wd strike it rich sometime soon!', '2008-06-07 05:24:42.000000', NULL, 0),
