(4756097, 682286, 70375, '<td valign="top">I love that you left in her freckles. So many people process out freckles and I think they give a lovely sense of persona in a portrait. Well done and congrats on the blue! :)</td>', 'I love that you left in her freckles. So many people process out freckles and I think they give a lovely sense of persona in a portrait. Well done and congrats on the blue! :)', '2008-06-07 15:09:24.000000', NULL, 0),
